<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">-Matengo Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">2Samw</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu sa pili saka Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli pu utumbuli sabia kitabu simu kikolongu sesamanyikana ngati Kitabu saka Samweli. Puutumbuli kitabu senze sabaganwa na kuba itabu ibeli yebiikemika, Litoleu la Septuagenti. Heli labiya lihengu lukutumbuli lukuandika Lilaganu la Mwandi kuhuma mu malobi giki Ebulania kujenda ku malobi giki Kiyunani. Liina liki kitabu hesi lilangi kubanga bandu babaandika kitabu sehesi babia asomi sabini au sabini na abeli bi Kiyahudi babaandika kitabu sehesi. Mu kitabu sehsi seandiki kwi Kigiliki, kitabu ya 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli biikemika 1 Ubambu Ukolongu na 2 Ubambu Ukolongu na mu kitabu seandiki kwa malobi gi Kilatini sebabiya aandiki baada ja hesi, itabu yeheyi biing'anambua nukuikema 1 Akabambu Akolongu na aka bambu Akolongu. Ndienu itabu heyi yeimanyikana lelenu ngati 1 Akabambu Akolongu na 2 Akabambu Akolongu biikema mu litoleu heli 3 na 4. Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli ilandi Samweli ejutamika na bambu nkolongu Sauli na bambu nkolongu Daudi. Samweli jabiya ndi kilongosi ja mwisu kipindi bandu buku Izilaeli pabanga'anambuka kuhuma mu kulongoswa na baatemu, nu kutumbuli kulongoswa na akabambu akolongu. Samweli jojakaninya mahuta Sauli na Daudi kuba akabambu akolongu abeli bukutumbuli ku Izilaeli. Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli ilandi majambu ga bandu bu nndema uku Izilaeli etamika kipindi hesi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nga mundu joamanyiki jojuandiki 1Samweli na 2Samweli. Jojuandiki ngasejililogwi mweni nkati ji itabu heyi, lakini kuwesikana jabii mwomi mu kipindi soti su ulongosi waka bambu nkolongu Daudi, pangi jahigali mwomi hata baada ju ulongosi hogu, na kabee jawesa kulinga nu kusoma makalatasi gangi gagalandi kutama kwaka Sauli na Samweli. Kulengana na haga galandi mundu au bandu baandiki itabu heyi. Kabee ngasekumanyakini itabu heyi iandikwi lile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Mulipungu 1-5 Lilandi namuna Daudi ejawesa kuba bambu nkolongu juku Yuda na mwenikatai kuba bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli kwoti.</para>
  <para style="io">Mulipungu 6-10 Lilandi namuna Daudi ejalongusa ngati bambu nkolongu na kwaawesa baja baki.</para>
  <para style="io">Mulipungu 11-12 Lilandi namuna Daudi ejahenga mahakau gu ugoni nukukoma, na namuna nndota Nasani eanndakaliya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mulipungu 13-20 Lilandi kung'anambuka Daudi mala ju utumbuli na mala ja pili.</para>
  <para style="io">Mulipungu 22-24 Lilandi majambu gukutama kwaka Daudi ngati Bambu nkolongu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jujoana Samweli jutei kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sauli ejabiya jukuwiki, Daudi jwabuja koni jaawesiki Ahamaleki, jwatama ku Sikilagi kwa masoba mabeli. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Lisoba la tatu jwahika mundu jumu kuhuma mu likambi laka Sauli, jojuwe jwaweti ingobu yeijendukini kulangi usungu koni jubii nu luombi kumutu anhikila Daudi nu kumpege magoti nukunzinamii mbaka pai. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi anndalukia mundu hoju, “Wehapa guhumiki kwako?” Najombi ampwagila, “Ndiliki kuhuma ku likambi la Aizilaeli.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi ampwagila, “Mbwagila majambu hegabi konioku.” Mundu jola jwajibua, “Bandu bitu atiliki kukomana na bingi bitu atei kuwa. Kabee Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki baakomiki.” <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi anndalukia nkombu jola, “Gumanya boo kubanga Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki atei kuwa?” <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Nkombu jola jwajibua, “Kwabi ana, nabii ku kitombi suku Giliboa kokwabii na ngondu na Sauli jwabii kola koni jujegami nkoa waki na magali gukukomane ngondu na baakwelale falasi bu upandi wa abaja babia bunhegali ngamaa. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Pajwang'anambuka nukumona jwangema, nanepani napwaga, ‘Boo, henu nhenga kike?’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Jombi jwanalukia, nepani nanyane na nepani nunzibua, nhumi ku Amaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Ndi jwambwagila ‘Hegalia gungoma ndaba anhumisi ngamaa mi nu ubini nkolongu. Lakini nakona namwome.’ <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Ndi najenda pambipi najombi nu kunkoma, ndaba nabia manyiki ana juabwiki pai nga juwesi kuba mwome kabete. Lakini seketule jejabii pikimutu jaki nu ukupu gowabii mu maboku gaki, yoti nuguleti wehapa, wabambu wangu.” <verse eid="2SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi jwakamula ingobu yaki nu kujendu ku usungu. Na bandu boti bababia pamu na Daudi bahenga ahelahela. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Balobalakiya nu kulela nu kupunga kula mbaka pakamii kwa ndaba jaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki nu nndema wa Aizilaeli na bandu baka Bambu Sapanga ndaba bingi babu bawii kungondu. <verse eid="2SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi anndalukia nkombu jojwaleta malobi jola, “Guhumi kwaa?” Jombi jwajibua, “Nepani nu Nhamaleki lakini ndama mu nndema waku ngati nngeni.” <verse eid="2SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi anndalukia, “Kwabii boo wehapa ngasewajogwipi kutondabee kuboku kwaku nukunkoma mundu jojuhaguliwi na Bambu Sapanga kukupakwa mahuta?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ndienu Daudi ankema jumu kati jaaka akombu baki nu kumpwagi, “Nkoma mundu hajo!” Nkombu jola anndapula Mmaleki jola, najombi Nhamaleki hoju jwatenda kuwa. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi jwapwaaga, “Kuwa kwaku hoku gulitaputi wamweti, ndaba gupwagiki wamweti kunndomu waku kubanga, ‘Nunkomiki mundu jojuhaguliwi na Bambu Sapanga sukunnzakani mahuta.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi julobalake ndaba ja kuwa kwaka Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi jalobalakiya sukunzembe nhwambu gongo kwa ndaba jaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki. <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Daudi jwapwaga bandu buku Yuda baabola nhwambu ukulobaleke hogu goguandikwi mu kitabu sa Yashali na Daudi jajemba, <verse eid="2SA 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Mwaa Izilaeli bandu bababia aka kilongosi bitu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Baakomiki pi kitombi saku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Hela ndi bandu bitu baabii na makili hebakomika.”<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Lijambu heli mwaapwagi bandu ba musi uku Gati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Wala mu inndela ya Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Ana witenda kwaapwagi akambomba Afilisiti biitenda kutogule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">akakamwali ba bandu banga kummanya Sapanga biitenda kutogulela.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mwabandu bi itombi yuku Giliboa, mwiipata ulumi wala iyula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">wala matui gagapapa matambiku gi ilebi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Ndaba hoku ndi ngau jaka mwana makili kojahabuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">ngau jaka Sauli ngabiipaki kabee mahuta.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Upendi waka Yonasani ngasewakelabwiki munnyuma hata kidogu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">upanga waka Sauli ngasewakelabwiki bwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">masoba goha yakoma bandu bingipi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Ena, yakoma bandu baamanyiki kukomana ngondu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">bandu bababia apalika nu kuneng'ane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Mu kutama kwabu bapalika nu kuneng'ane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Babi ni kipyau kupeta tai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Ena, babia bana makili kupeta liimba.”<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Akambomba buku Izilaeli, munndelila Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Jwaawatika ingobu ngeli yeinyambiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">jwalembiki ingobu yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">kwa mapambu ga zahabu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Kwa namuna boo bandu bana makili hebaabuka bandu baamanyiki kukomana na ngondu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Akuiki koni abii mu kukomana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasani jugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">koni jukuiki kukitombi.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Nepani nela kwa ndaba jaku, unndongu wangu wa Yonasani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Masoba goti gubii mundu waamboni kwangu nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">upali waku kwangu nepani gubii gutenda kusangasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">upali waku gutenda kusangasa kupeta ukummbomba.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Namuna bandu baamanyiki kukomana ngondu heahabwiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">na hindu yabu yukukomane atei kuileka ngaseibii na mahengo.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi bunhenga kuba bambu nkolongu juku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Hegapeta majambu haga Daudi andalukia Bambu Sapanga kupwaga, “Bo, nyenda lee ku musi gumu kati ja misi juku Yuda?” Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Gujendaje.” Daudi andalukia, “Nyenda ku musi bole?” Bambu Sapanga jwajibua, “Ujenda ku musi uku Ebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ndi Daudi jwajenda ku Hebuloni pamu na aka ahanu baki abeli, Ahinoamu juku Yezileeli na Abigaeli jojuwe alomi baki babiya Nabali bababia akuwiki, mundu juku musi uku Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Jwaajukua bandu baki, kila mundu koni jubi pamu nunndongu waki nabombi batama mu misi jejabii pambipi nuku Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Bandu buku Yuda bunzendila Daudi ku Hebuloni nu kunzakani mahuta ili jubia bambu nkolongu wabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Daudi pajwajowana kubanga bandu buku Yebeshi Gileadi ndi babunntaga Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />jaatuma bandu ku Yabeshi Gileadi kupwaga, “Bambu Sapanga jumpengila ndaba mwalangia kunzetake Sauli bambu winu sukuntaga. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Henu, Bambu Sapanga junndangia waamboni na kuba jojuhobaleka kwinu. Nanepani kabee nanhengila majambu gaamboni ndaba jilijambu lenhengiki. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Lakini mmbia nganganganga na mwanga kujogopa. Sauli bambu winu jutei kuwa na bandu buku Yuda anyakani mahuta nepani ili mia bambu nkolongu wabo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti bunhimika kuba bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abuneli mwana waka Neli nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu baka Sauli jwabia anzukwi Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli nukumpeleka ku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Hoku Abuneli anhimika kuba bambu nkolongu juku nndema uku Giliadi nuku Ashulu nuku Efulaimu nuku Benyamini nuku Izilaeli kwoti. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti jwabia na yaka alubaini pajwatumbulia kulongosa ku Izilaeli najombi jwalongusa kwa yaka ibeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:10">Lakini likabila la Yuda lumpwata Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi jwabia bambu nkolongu wi likabila la Yuda kwa yaka saba na nusu, jwabia jutama ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondu kati ja bandu buku Izilaeli na bandu Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abuneli mwana waka Neli, pamu na aka kilongosi baka Ishibosheti, jojuwe mwana waka Sauli baboka ku Mahanaimu nukujenda ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana waka Seluya naaka atumisi bangi baka Daudi nabombi bapita nu kuketangana na Abuneli na bandu bajwabii naku ku litanda lelabi ku Gibeoni. Likundi limu labii upandi gumu wi litanda ni likundi lengi labia upandi gongi wilitanda. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abuneli ampwagila Yoabu, “Waajetakia kwaaleka aka akombu baku akomana palongi jitu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoabu jwajibua, “Hena.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Ndi bapitila akakombu ishilini nu nsesi, upandi wilikabila laka Benyamini na Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, aka akombu komi na abeli nu upandi waka Daudi akaakombu komi na abeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Kila jumu ankamula mbaja waki kimutu nukunhoma upanga ndi boti abeli baabuka pai koni awii. Ndi pandu pala bapakema Helikati hazulimu mana jaki lunaza lwa mapanga, pandujee pala pabii ku Gibeoni kola.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Ngondu ya masoba ge haga jabii ingali. Bandu baka Daudi baalapwi ngamaa bandu baka Abuneli na bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Bana atatu baka Seluya, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaeli babia apalapala. Asaeli jwabia niimbelu ngati holoku. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaeli ammbenga Abuneli sanga kung'anambuka upandi wamalele wala upandi wamangega. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abuneli pajwang'anambuka munyuma nukummbona Asaeli andalukia, “Bo, wehapa lee wa Asaele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Jombi jwajibua, “Hena anenganenga.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abuneli ampwagila, “Ng'anambukia upandi wa kumalele au uku mangega unkamula nkombu jumu nu kunyaga hindu yaki.” Lakini Asaeli ngasejwakotwiki kummbenga. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abuneli ampwagila Asaeli mala ja pili, “Gukotuka kumbwata. Ndaba jakii nugukomaje? Niiwesa boo, kuketangana nu nndongu waku Yoabu?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Lakini Asaeli jwatenda kukana. Ndi Abuneli anhosa nkoa mulutumbu kianganyuma nu nkoa we gola wapitila mu nngongu waka Asaeli. Asaeli jwaabuka pai na kuwa apalapala. Bandu boha babahika pandu pajwawelila Asaeli bajema kinunu.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Lakini Yoabu na Abishai bumpwata Abuneli. Lioba palabia litenda kujingi bahika ku kitombi sa Ama sekibii upandi golipiti lyoba uku Gia ku indela jejijenda kulukoba lwa Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Bandu bilikabila la Benyamini baegalania pamu nakuba munyuma jaka Abuneli ndi balenganakia likundi labu nabombi bajema panani jikitombi. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ndienu Abuneli ankema Yoabu nu kunndaluki, “Boo, twiikomana le masoba gote? Boo, ngasegubona mwisu wiibia ling'ae? Boo, wiiendalia ku kipindi boo, kwaakolo bandu baku akotuka kutupwatali twepani twa alongu babo?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu ampwagila, “Napa kwaka Sapanga jojubii mwomi kubanga ananga waka pwagiki lijambu heli sakaka bandu bangu bakaendalia kwaapwatali alongu babu mbaka kilabu pulukela.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ndi Yoabu jwajemba imbata na bandu bakotuka kwaapwatali bandu buku Izilaeli wala ngasebaendalia kukomana.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abuneli na bandu baki bapeta ligomba luku Alaba kelukelu. Balombuka losi Yoludani, bajenda pipipipi mbaka ku Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu pajwabuja kuhuma kumpwatali Abuneli jwaakusanya bandu baki boti, jwamanya kubanga atumisi komi na tisa baka Daudi ngasebabi pamu na bombe, pamu na Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Lakini atumisi baka Daudi babia baakomiki bandu mia tatu na sitini kuhuma mu likabila laka Benyamini pamu na bandu baka Abuneli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na bandu baki bajukua yega jaka Asaheli nukujitaga mulitenge la atati baki lelibii ku Betilehemu. Yoabu na bandu baki bajenda ikilu kelukelu na hekwakusa bahika ku musi uku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kwabia na ngondu ja masoba gingi kati ja bandu babumpala Sauli na bandu babumpala Daudi. Lakini Daudi jwaendalia kupata makili ngani nu upandi waka Sauli waendalia kuhuluka makili namangani.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana akanalomi baka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Bana akanalomi bajwaapapiki Daudi ku Hebuloni, babiya Amnoni jwabiya mwana waki na anyongo baki babia Ahinoamu kuhuma ku Yezileeli. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Kileabu jabiya mwana waki wa pili, amabaki babia Abigaili jojwabi nhwanu waka Nabali kabla jakuwa, jombi jwaumila ku Kalimeli. Abusalomu nsaliwa waki jwa tatu, anyongo baki babia Maaka jojwabia kamwali waka Talimai bambu juku Geshuli, <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Adoniya ndi nsaliwa waki junsesi amabu baki babia Hagiti, Shefatia jwabia nsaliwa waki jwa tanu na anyongo baki babia Abiatali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />na Iteleamu jwabia nsaliwa waki wa sita anyongo baki babia Egila nhwanu waka Daudi. Haba ndi bana bajwapapiki Daudi pajwabia ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abuneli jujongana na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Kipindi sa ngondu kati ja bandu baka Sauli na bandu baka Daudi, Abuneli jwabia jutenda kuliandaa ili jubiya bambu nkolongu mu nyumba jaka Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli jwabia ni libangu limu lebilikema Lisipa kamwali waka Aya. Lisoba limu Ishibosheti anndalukia Abuneli, “Ndaba jaki gugoni ni libangu la atati bango?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abuneli jwayoma ngamaa ndaba malobi gaka Ishibosheti jwapwaga, “Boo, guwasali nepani nhwesa kung'anambuka Sauli? Boo, guwasali nepani ndumakia bandu buku Yuda lena? Linga nepani mi na mundu jojwaajowane bandu ba atati baku Sauli, alongu baki na aka akosi baki na ngasenugukamwi nu kugupeleka kwaka Daudi mbaka lelenu. Lakini lelenu gumona nummbaja ndaba juku mmbomba. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Sapanga jungomaa ana nganiihengi majambu gajulapiki Bambu Sapanga kwaka Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Bambu Sapanga anndapila Daudi kubanga jwaguboa ubambu ukolongu kuhuma kwaka Sauli kujenda kwaki Daudi najombi jwiibia bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli na Yuda kuhuma ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti ngasejawesiki kulonge lilobi lokapi ndaba jwabia anzogopa Abuneli.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ndi Abuneli jwaatuma bandu ku Hebuloni kwaka Daudi bukumpwagila, “Boo nndema gongo waka nyane? Gujetangana nanepani, nanepani nagujangatia kuguhenga nndema uku Izilaeli gubiya mali gaku.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi anzibua, “Hena niijetanganiya na wehapa. Lakini mbala lijambu limu kuhuma kwaku. Wiihika palongi jangu mbaka pa wanndeta Mikali kamwali waka Sauli. Hapa ndi pawimona.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Daudi kabee jwaatuma bandu kwaka Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli kupwaga, “Gungelabukia nhwanu wangu Mikali jonunnzukuwa kwa ngosi mia jimu ya Afilisiti yeyapatikana kupete kuseku jandu.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ndi Ishibosheti jwatuma bandu bukunnzukua Mikali kuhuma kuku nndomi waki, Palitieli mwana waka Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Lakini Palitieli jwajenda pamu nunhwanu waki koni julela mwiindela joti mbaka ku Baulimu. Abuneli ampwagila Patilieli, “Gubuja kunyumba.” Najombi jwatenda kubuja.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abuneli jwalongila na aseja buku Izilaeli, jwaapwagila, “Masoba gingi gagapetiki mwapala Daudi jubia bambu nkolongu wii. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Henu nndeta lijambu heli kwa bandu ndaba Bambu Sapanga anndagila Daudi kubanga, ‘Kupete wa Daudi untumisi wangu naahokula bandu buku Izilaeli kuhuma kwa Afilisiti na kwa abaja babu bingi.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abuneli jwalongila na Abenyamini nu kujenda mbaka ku Hebuloni kumpwagi Daudi kupete goti gabalagani kuhenga na bandu boti buku Izilaeli na bi likabila loti luku Benyamini. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abuneli eanzendila Daudi, jwabia na bandu ishilini na Daudi jwaahengila matola. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abuneli ampwagila Daudi, “Nepani niijenda nukugulete bandu boti buku Izilaeli wehapa wabambu nkolongu wangu. Biika nukuhenga lilaganu pamu na wehapa ili gubia wabambu nkolongu wabu na wehapa waalongusa boti kulengana na hewiipala.” Daudi antabuka Abuneli jujenda, najombi jwaboka kulukwali.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu ankoma Abuneli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Mweni katai Yoabu pamu na bandu bangi baka Daudi babuja kuhuma kukukomana ngondu, baleta hindu hingi ye biinyagiki. Lakini Abuneli ngasejwabi pamu na Daudi ku Hebuloni kola ndaba Daudi jwabia antabwiki jujenda, najombi jwaboka ku lukwali. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu pajwabuja koni jubii na akomana ngondu baki boti bajwabia naku, bumpwagila kubanga Abuneli mwana waka Neli jwahikiki kummbona bambu nkolongu Daudi najombi antabwiki jujendaje, najombi jubokiki ku lukwali. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu anzendila bambu nkolongu nu kumpwagi, “Henu guhengiki kii? Linga Abuneli jwahika kwaku, ndaba jaki gunndekiki jujendaje? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Boo, gumanyiki Abuneli mwana waka Neli jwahikiki kugukonga? Jwahikiki ili jumanya majambu gaku na kila seguhenga.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu pajwahuma kulonge na Daudi jwaatuma bandu ajenda kunkema Abuneli na bombi bunketania ku kiliba suku Sila nu kunkelabu, lakini Daudi ngasejwamanyiki lijambu hele. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abuneli pajwabuja ku Hebuloni, Yoabu anzukua pulutengu ji litanga ngati kummbole sindu. Ndi Yoabu ansekula Abuneli mu lutumbu ndaba Abuneli jwabia ankomiki Asaheli nndongu waki na Abuneli jwatenda kuwa. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Daudi pajwajowana hela jwapwaga, “Nepani nu ubambu wangu ngasetubii na makosa palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kupete Abuneli mwana waka Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Likosa lukukoma hoku libia panani jikimutu saka Yoabu na bandu boti ba kwaatati baki! Aka alongu baka Yoabu biikosa mundu jojubii nu ugonzu wikisononu au ugonzu ukulela nhyega au mundu jojujende mikongu au kukomeka ku upanga au inzala!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu nu nndongu waki Abishai bunkoma Abuneli ndaba jwabia junkomiki nndongu wabu Asaheli kipindi sukukomana ku ngondu ku Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila Yoabu na bandu boti bababia pamu najombi ajendula ingobu yabu awata magunii ili bunndobalakia Abuneli. Kipindi sukuntaga Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwabia jujenda mu nyuma ji lisanduku. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abuneli buntaga ku Hebuloni na bambu nkolongu jwatenda kunndele kwa sauti koni jubi pulutengu ji litenge, kabe bandu bangi boti bahenga ahelahe. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Bambu nkolongu anndelila Abuneli koni jupwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">Boo, kwabii boo Abuneli jwakuwa ngati nng'ang'a?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Maboku gaku ngasebagakongike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">na magolu gaku ngasebagakongiki pengu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Jukuiki ngati mundu jobunkomiki bandu abaja! Na bandu boti bunndelila kabee.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Ndi bandu boti bajenda kunkolo Daudi jukula libumunda pakwabia kwakona mui. Lakini Daudi jwalapa koni jwaapwagi, “Sapanga jungoma anaonziki libumunda au sindu sokapi kabula lioba kujingi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Bandu boti bagabona majambu haga, nabombi kwatenda kwaalengane ngati kila sindu sejwahenga bambu nkolongu hesaalengani. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ndi lisoba lela Aizilaeli boti bamanya kubanga ngaselabii liwasu laka bambu nkolongu Daudi kunkoma Abuneli mwana waka Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Bambu nkolongu jwaapwagila atumisi baki, “Boo, ngase mmanya lelenu mundu nkolongu na jojumanyikana namangani jukuhiki pa Izilaeli pane? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Hata ngati nnyakani mauta ili mia bambu nkolongu, lakini lelenu nepani nzokiki makili. Bana baka Seluya haba abaja ngamaa. Bambu Sapanga jwaalapula abaja haba kulengana nu ubaja wabu.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti atenda kunkoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli pajwajowana Abuneli atei kunkoma ku Hebuloni, jwasoka makili mmoju na bandu boti buku Izilaeli babiya nu lujogopu. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, jwabia na bandu abeli bababia aka kilongosi bi ikundi yukutukali kungondu, jumu bunkema Baana na jongi Lekabu. Haba babia bana baka Limoni, mundu julikabila la Benyamini kuhuma ku musi uku Beeloti, ndaba musi uku Beeloti wabia wa bandu bi likabila la Benyamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Bandu buku Beeloti batilila ku Gitaimu na batama hoku ngati ageni mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonasani mwana waka Sauli jwabia na mwana jojwabi julemi magolu gaki goti gabeli. Mwana we hoju bunkema Mefibosheti. Mefibosheti jwabia na yaka nhwanu pakwajowanika kuwa kwaka Sauli na Yonasani kuhuma ku Yezileeli. Mundu jojwabia antunza pajwajowana Sauli na Yonasani baakomiki ku Yezileeli, anzukua Mefibosheti nukutila naku. Lakini pajwabia jutila nyatanyata mwana jola jwatei kuabuka, nukupata kilema.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Lekabu na Baana bana baka Limoni mundu juku Beeloti, bajenda kunyumba kwaka Ishibosheti. Bahika kola kipindi sa lyoba mutu kipindi Ishibosheti pajwabia jupomule kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Bajingala mu sumba sunkati bilihenga ngati apala kujuku inganu, bunhosa nkoa Ishibosheti mulitumbu. Ndi Lekabu na Baana nndongu waki batendakutila. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Bajingala munyumba kipindi jutei kugone pikitanda mu sumba saki. Baada jukunhosa nkoa pikitanda saki nukunkoma bunsekula kimutu saki. Koni akijukwi bajenda ikilu joka kwiindela ja Alaba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Bunndetila Daudi kimutu saka Ishibosheti ku Hebuloni kola, Bumpwagila bambu, “Senze kimutu saka Ishibosheti mwana waka Sauli, mbaja waku jojwalengiki kugukoma. Lelenu Bambu Sapanga jugulepi kisasi wabambu nkolongu wangu kwaka Sauli ni ibeleku yaki.” <verse eid="2SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Daudi anzibwa Lekabu na Baana nndongu waki, bana baka Limoni, mundu juku Beeloti, jwapwaga, “Sakaka ngati bambu Sapanga hejubii jojunhokwi kuhuma mu tabu yoti, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />mundu jola jojahika kumbwagi kubannga, ‘Sauli jutei kuwa.’ Jwawasalia junete lijambu laamboni, nunkamula nukunkoma ku Sikilagi. Hogu ndi nhupi gonumpekia kwandaba ja malobi gaki. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Boo mundu mmbaja paankoma mundu jwaamboni koni jugoni pikitanda saki panyumba jaki, boo, kuwesikana nepani kunndeka bila kummpeke azabu jukunkoma nukummboa punndema?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Ndi Daudi jwaalagalakia bandu baki, nabombi batenda kwaakoma. Baasekula maboku gabu na magolu gabu. Ndi baatonga mu nkongu pulutengu junhanga nkolongu ku Hebuloni. Lakini bikijukua kimutu saka Ishibosheti nu kukitaga muli tenge laka Abuneli ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jukuba bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli nuku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1Majambu gi Ipindi 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Ndienu makabila goti guku Izilaeli gunzendila Daudi ku Hebuloni, nukumpwagi, “Linga twepani twaalongu bako. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Kipindi Sauli pajwabia bambu nkolongu witu wehapa ndi wewaalongua Aizilaeli ku ngondu, na Bambu Sapanga jugupwagila, ‘Wiibia nndimi wa bandu bango buku Izilaeli na wiibia wikilongosi juku Izilaeli.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ndienu akakilongosi boka buku Izilaeli bunzendila bambu nkolongu Daudi ku Hebuloni, najombi jajetangana nabu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ndienu anzakania Daudi mahuta ili jubia bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi jwabia na yaka selasini pajwatumbulia kulongosa na jwalongusa kwa yaka alubaini. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ku Hebuloni jwalongusa bandu buku Yuda kwa yaka saba na miei sita nuku Yelusalemu jwaalongusa bandu buku Izilaeli pamu na Yuda kwa yaka selasini na tatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Mwenikatai bambu nkolongu na akomana ngondu baki bajenda ku Yelusalemu kwaalapu Ayebusi bababia benei bunndema hogu. Lakini bombi bumpwagila, “Ngagujingi mu musi mombo, ndaba bandu banga kulinga na baalemi bagubengila kutali.” Bumpwagila hela ndaba bawasalia Daudi ngajwakawesi kujingi mu musi homu. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Hata hela bambu nkolongu Daudi jujinyaga nyumba ja akomana ngondu juku Sioni yaani musi waka Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Lisoba heli Daudi japwaga, “Mundu jokapi jojwaalapula Ayebusi na jupitila mu nkolule wa masi ili kwaalapu babii ni kilema na bandu banga kulinga babube loho jangu jitenda kwaasuki.” Ndaba bandu apwaga, “Bandu banga kulinga niilema ngabiijingi munyumba jiki bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi jwatama ku nyumba ja akomana ngondu jela, na musi wegola jugukema, “Musi waka Daudi.” Daudi jugusenga musi sukuguyongolota kutumbuli ku Milo kujenda nkati. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Daudi jwabia na makili kipindi soti ndaba Bambu Sapanga Jojubii na Makili jwabii pamu najombi.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Ndi Hilamu bambu nkolongu juku Tilo jwaatuma bandu kwaka Daudi, kabee ampelakia mikongu ji mielezi na akapundi bukulanda na akapundi bukusenga babunsengila Daudi nyumba jikibambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ndi Daudi jwamanya kubanga Bambu Sapanga anhengiki kuba nganganganga ili jubia bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli na jugukoiki ubambu ukolongu waki kwa ndaba ja bandu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi julijukuli mabangu na akambomba bingi kupeta bababia kumusi uku Yelusalemu baada jukuhuma ku Hebuloni. Haba bummbelakia bana bingi akanalomi na aka mbomba. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Ganga ndi maina ga bana akanalomi kuhuma kwaka ahanu baki babumbelaki ku Yelusalemu, Shamua na Shobabu na Nasani na Solomoni, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibali na Elishua na Nefeli na Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama na Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwesa kwa Afilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1Majambu gi Ipindi 14:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Afilisiti pabajowana kubanga Daudi bunzakani mahuta kuba bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, boti baboka kujenda kuntaputa lakini jwombi jwapata majambu jwajingala nkati ja nyumba ja akomana ngondu. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Afilisiti bahika nu kulipesangana ku Ligomba luku Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ndi Daudi anndalukia Bambu Sapanga, “Boo, nyenda lee nakaalapulaje?” Najombi Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">“Jendaje, ndaba sakaka naguhenga wawesa Afilisiti!”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Ndienu Daudi jwahika ku Baali Pelasimu nakola jwaawesa Afilisiti. Ndi jwapwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jupetiki pikilanda ja abaja bangu ngati kikoka sa masi gagajenda nyatanyata.” Ndi pandu pala bapakama Baali Pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Afilisiti biileka imong'umong'u yabu yiisapanga pandu pala na Daudi na bandu baki batenda kuijukua.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Mala ja pili Afilisiti bahika kabe nukulipesangana ku ligomba luku Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi paanndoba Bambu Sapanga, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Waalapu kuhuma pagubii hapa ila guyonguluta na kwaalapu kutumbuli pambipi ni mikongu ji mifolosadi.” <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Na pamwiijowana kujenda kwa bandu kuhuma ku mikongu ji mifolosadi jenda nyata ndaba kwiibia kulangi Bambu julonguli palongi jaku <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi jwahenga ngati Bambu Sapanga heandagalaki najombi jwaalapula Afilisiti kuhuma ku Geba mbaka ku Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku li Lilaganu apeleka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1Majambu gi Ipindi 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25">15:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 16:6-43">16:6-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Kabee Daudi jwaakema bandu elupu selasini buku Izilaeli baaguliwi. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi jwaboka nukujenda pamu na bandu baki boti bajwabii nabu kuhuma ku Baala Yuda, kujenda kulijuku lisanduku laka Sapanga lebilikema ku liina laki Bambu Sapanga jwana makili, jojutama pikiteu saki su ubambu panani ji iumbi yeibii na makapatii. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Ndi bilijukua Lisanduku laka Sapanga kuhuma mu nyumba jaka Abinadabu jejabii kukitombi, nukulitoto mu ligali linyai. Uza na Ahio bana baka Abinadabu babia biliendesa ligali linyai heli, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />koni libii ni Lisanduku laka Sapanga heli najombi Ahio koni julongule palongi ji Lisanduku heli. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na bandu boti buku Izilaeli babia aina palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kwa makili gabu goti kwa nyembu niimbata na zeze na matalizi ni ilimba na matoazi. <verse eid="2SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Pabaika pu lubanza lukupete ilebi uku Nakoni, Uza jwatondabia kuboku kwaki nu kulikamulaki Lisanduku laka Sapanga kwa ndaba ng'ombi yela yatei kulikobando.<verse eid="2SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Pala ndi Bambu Sapanga ayomila Uza. Sapanga ankoma apalapala. Uza jakuwa apalapala pulutengu ji Lisanduku laka Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Najombi Daudi jwayomiki ndaba Bambu Sapanga ankoma Uza kwi inyela. Ndi pandu je pala mbaka lelenu bapakema Pelesi Uza.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Lisoba heli Daudi anzogopa Bambu Sapanga nukupwaga, “Henu linhikila boo Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Ndi Daudi ngasejwajetaki kulipeleka Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga ku musi waka Daudi, ila Daudi julipelika kunyumba jaka Obedi Edomu mundu juku musi uku Giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga heli latama kunyumba jaka Obedi Edomu miei mitatu, na Bambu Sapanga ampengila Obedi Edomu pamu na alongu baki.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi pajwajowana kubanga Bambu Sapanga jwaapengi bandu bi kibeleku saka Obedi Edomu na hindu yoti yejwabii nayu ndaba ji Lisanduku laka Sapanga, jwajenda kulijuku Lisanduku lililaganu kuhuma kunyumba jaka Obedi Edomu nukulipeleka kumusi waka Daudi sukutogule. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Bandu bala babilitotwi Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga kila ebajenda hatua sita Daudi jwapia matambiku gi likambaku la ng'ombi nakatoli kamu kakakendiki. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi koni julikongiki kizibau suku nngolu mukibunu saki jwahina kwa makili gaki goti palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ndienu jwombi na Aizilaeli boti bilipeleka Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga mbaka ku musi kwaka Daudi kwa ndogule na kwa sauti ngolongu ji imbata.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga palabia lijingi mu musi waka Daudi, Mikali kamwali waka Sauli jwalingalia pi lindilisa ammbona bambu nkolongu Daudi juhombahomba nu kuhina palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ndienu jwatenda kundongama mu mwoju waki. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Ndienu bilijingia Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga nkati jili hema lelule Daudi jwatei kulihimika kwa ndaba ji Lisanduku heli. Na mweni Daudi jwapia matambiku gu kutinyi na matambiku gu lukwali palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi pajwajomula kupia matambiku gukutinyi na gu lukwali jwaapengalia bandu kuliina laka Bambu Sapanga jwana makili, <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />na jwaabagulia mabumunda na maandasi ga tendi na ga zabibu nyomu kwa bandu boti Aizilaeli, aka mbomba na aka nalomi kila jumu libumunda ni kipandi siinyama ni libumunda la zabibu. Mweni katai bandu boa batenda kuboka kila mundu jwabuja kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi pajwabuja kunyumba jaki ili kwaapenge alongu baki, Mikali kamwali waka Sauli jwajenda kumpengana koni jupwaga, “Linga lelenu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli hejulipoiki lihamu, sukuyeku heu jaki palongi ja atumisi baki akanalomi na aka mbomba ngati ng'ang'a hejuula ingobu yaki palongi ja bandu sanga iyoni.”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi ampwagila Mikali, “Nakabi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga jojwanhagula nepani badala ja atati bako, na alongu bake, ili mia ni kilongosi jwa Aizilaeli, bandu baki bambu Sapanga, henu nepani nihina pee palongi jaka bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Nalihulua namweti namangani kupeta sajenu. Wehapa wiimona ngasindo lakini atumisi akambomba hab bawaapwagi biindendila isima.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Ndienu Mikali kamwali waka Sauli ngasejwabii na mwana mbaka kuwa kwaki.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Malagalaki gaka Sapanga kwaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 17:1-15">17:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Bambu nkolongu pajabiya jutama mu lijumba laki likibambu, najwombi Bambu Sapanga anhwesisa kuba nu lukwali na abaja baki boti kila upandi, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila nndota Natani, “Linga hoti nepani ndama mu nyumba jeasengiki kwi mikongu ji mielezi lakini Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga litama mu lihema.” <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natani ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Jenda ukahenga lokapi leguwasali mu mwoju waku ndaba Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu na wehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Lakini ikilu ajelajela lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Natani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Jenda ukumpwagila ntumisi wangu Daudi, ‘Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, boo, wehapa le wiinzengila nyumba jukutama? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Ngase ndemi nkati ja nyumba toka lisoba le naaleta Aizilaeli kuhuma ku Misili mbaka lelenu. Nyendiki kila pandu koni ndama mu lihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Boo, kila pandu panyendiki pamu na Aizilaeli boti, nunndalukiya, jubii mundu jokapi juku Izilaeli jonunndagalaki jwaatunza bandu buku Izilaeli, ndaba jaki ngasejunzengi nyumba ji mikongu ji mielezi?’”<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Henu gumpwagila ntumisi wangu Daudi, Bambu Sapanga jojubii na makili jupwaga ana, nugupia kukiholi kowabia gulima makondo ili gubia ukilongosi wa bandu bangu ku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Tumbuka kipindi sehesi mii nawehapa kokapi kogujenda na naakomiki abaja baku boha palongi jako. Naguhenga kuba wa mundu nkolongu ngati eabii akolongu bangi munndema. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Nanepani nahagulia bandu bangu Aizilaeli pandu pukutama, naabeka ili atama pandu pabu beni, biisumbuka kabee. Bandu abaja baatumi makili nga baang'alisi kabete ngati pa mwande, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />tumbuka panahagula bandu bukwatemu bandu bangu Aizilaeli, nepani niitenda kugulenda abaja baku boti ngabaguwese. “ ‘Kabee nepani Bamba Sapanga nugupwagi nagusengila nyumba. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Masoba gaku pa giitimia na pawiikuwa nu kutagwa mumatenge ga baatagiki akatati baku nanhenga jumu jwa bana baku wamweti jubia bambu nkolongu nanepani naguhenga ubambu waki gubia na makili. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Jwombi ndi jojwiisenga nyumba kwa ndaba ji liina lango ni kiteu su ubambu waki nakibeka kibia na makili yaka yanga na mwisu. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nepani niibia atati baki, najombi jwiibia mwanango. Ana juhengiki kihakau nampekia azabu, ngati bandu hebaalapu bana babu kwi iboku. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Lakini nganumboke upali wangu ngati henumbokila Sauli jonummboa palongi jaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Lukolu lwaku nu ubambu ukolongu waku wiibia nganganganga masoba goti. Kiteu saku su ubambu kiibia nganganganga masoba goti ganga na mwisu.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Natani ampwagila Daudi kila sindu seanhyekuliwi Sapanga.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi juloba su kunsengu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1Majambu gi Ipindi 17:16-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Daudi jwajingala nkati nukutama palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga nukuloba ana, “Nepani nanya mwaa Bambu Sapanga na alongu bangu ndi kii mbaka gungweiki mbaka pamii lelenu? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Kabee lijambu leni labii lisoku pe pamiu jaku, Bambu Sapanga pamu na haga waalagii alongu bangu majambu makolongu mu yaka ingi yeihika na gunhwesisi kugabona, mwaa Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Nugupwagila kii kabete, nepani Daudi ntumisi waku? Ndaba wehapa gumanyiki nepani nu ntumisi waku, mwaa Bambu Sapanga! <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kulengana ni lilagii laku na mwoju waku guhengiki majambu makolongu goti haga ili gumanyisa nepani ntumisi waku. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Kulengana na gatugajowini, kubanga wehapa Bambu Sapanga ndi gunkolongu na ngajojubii ngati wehapa na ngasejubii Sapanga jongi kabete ila wehapa. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Kabee bandu boo, punndema pani baawesa kulengana na bandu baku bawakombwi ili abia bandu baki? Mwaa Sapanga wilihengila liina nu kulihenge majambu makolongu na gukusangasa kwa ndaba ju nndema waku palongi ja bandu bu nndema waku palongi ja bandu baku babube kwa ndaba jaku wamweti waakombwi kuhuma ku Misili, na kwaabenga bandu bandema yengi ni isapanga yaki palongi jabu? <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Waagangamalisi bandu baku buku Izilaeli kwa ndaba jaku wamweti ili abia bandu baku masoba ganga na mwisu, mwaa Bambu Sapanga gubii wa Sapanga wabu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Enu, mwaa Bambu Sapanga guhenga lilaganu lewanagalaki nepani ntumisi waku nu kwa alongu bangu ngati hewaalagila. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Ni liina laku liilumbalika masoba ganga na mwisu na bandu biipwaga, ‘Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwana makili goa Sapanga juku Izilaeli.’ Na bandu bu nyumba jangu, nepani Daudi ntumisi waku jiigangamalika palongi jaku. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Ndaba mwaa Bambu Sapanga jwana makili goti, Sapanga jwa Azilaeli gunhyekuli nepani ntumisi waku kupwaga, ‘Wiinzengila nyumba,’ ndi ndaba mii na makili kuguloba lijambu heli palongi jaku.”<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Henu mwaa Bambu Sapanga, wehapa ndi wa Sapanga na malobi gaku ndi sakaka na gunagi nepani ntumisi waku lijambu lende laamboni, <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />henu nuguloba nyumba jangu nepani ntumisi waku jiwesa kutama masoba goa ganga na mwisu palongi jaku, ndaba wehapa gupwagiki hela, kabee kupete mbenge yaku ibeleku yangu yiipengiwa masoba ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuwesa kwaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Egapeta majambu haga, Daudi jwaalapula na kwaawesa Afilisiti. Juukamula musi uku Metegi Ama kuhuma ku ulongosi wa Afilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Kabee jwaawesa Amoabu. Jwaapanga mu misitali bandu bajwaakamwi na kwagoneka pai. Jwaalagalakiya bandu bababia mu misitali mibeli baakoma na bababia mu nsitali watatu baaleka bomi. Ndienu Amoabu babia atumisi baka Daudi na babia bunndepa kodi. <verse eid="2SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Daudi kabee anhwesa bambu nkolongu juku Soba, Hadadezeli mwana waka Lehobu, Hadadezeli pajwabia jujenda kugukelabu lieneu la losi luku Eufulati ili libia mu ulongosi waki. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi jwanyaga magali gaki na angondu elupu jimu na akomana ngondu baakwelale falasi elupu jimu na mia saba na akomana ngondu baajenda kwa magolu elupu ishilini. Daudi jwaasekula falasi yoti yeihuta magali misipa ja mu magolu ila pe falasi mia jimu ngasejuisekwile. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Nabombi Aalamu buku Damasiki pabajenda kunnzangati Hadadezeli, bambu nkolongu juku Soba Daudi jwaalapula na kwaakoma bandu elupu ishilini ni ibeli. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Ndienu Daudi jwabeka akomana ngondu mu ubambu ukolongu wa Aalamu ku Damesiki nabombi Aalamu babia atumisi baki nukunndepa kodi. Bambu Sapanga annzangatiya Daudi kuwesa ngondu pokapi pajwajeenda. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi jwajukwaa ngau ya zaabu yebatotula akomana ngondu ba Hadadezeli nukupeleka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Kuhuma misi ja Beta na Belotai jejuje jalongusa Hadadezeli, bambu nkolongu Daudi jatola madini gingi ga shaba.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Toi bambu nkolongu juku Hamati pajwajowana kubanga Daudi jwaawesiki akomana ngondu boti baka Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />jwaamua kuntuma Yolamu mwana waki kwaka bambu nkolongu Daudi kunndamuki nukunndumbali ndaba ju kuwesa kwaki mu ngondu pamu na Hadadezeli ndaba Hadadezeli jwabia jukomini ngondu na Toi. Yolamu anndetila Daudi yombu yealenganaki na madini ga feza na madini ga zaabu na madini ga shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi juibeka yombu hei mu nyumba jaka Sapanga pamu na madini ga feza na madini ga zaabu gababia bagajopiki bandu bi milema jengi bababia baawesiki, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />kutumbuli ku Edomu nuku Moabu nuku Amoni na kwa Afilisiti na kwa Amaleki. Kabee japia kwaka Bambu Sapanga hindu ye jwanyaga kuhuma ku Hadadezeli mwana waka Lehobu bambu nkolongu Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Najombi Daudi jwamanyikana ngani ejabuja baada jukunhwesa bambu nkolongu Hadadezeli, jwaakoma Aedomu elupu komi na nani mu ligomba la mwinyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Jwaabeka kambi ya akomana ngondu bukulonda mu Edomu joka, nabombi Aedomu babia atumisi baka Daudi. Bambu Sapanga annzangati Daudi kuwesa kokapi kojajendaje. <verse eid="2SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Daudi jaalongua Aizilaeli boka koni juhenga majambu gaamboni kwa bandu boha jwaahengila ngati ekupalika. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana waka Seluya jwabia nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu na Yehoshafati mwana waka Ahiludi jwabia jojubeka ngombuke. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana waka Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana waka Abiatali babia aka agolu baka Sapanga na Seluya jwabia nhandishi. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada jwabia kilongosi jwa Akileti na Apeleti nabombi bana baka Daudi babia agolu baka Sapanga.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Lisoba limu Daudi jwalalukia, “Boo, jubii lee mundu jokapi jojuigali ku kilongu saka Sauli? Ana jubii mbala nunhengila gaamboni ndaba jaka Yonasani.” <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kwakabii nu ntumisi wikilongu saka Sauli jobunkema Siba. Siba bunkema jujenda kwaka Daudi. Bambu nkolongu Daudi anndalukia, “Boo, wehapa lee wa Siba?” Najombi jwajibua, “Ena nepani nuntumisi waku Siba.” <verse eid="2SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Bambu nkolongu anndalukia, “Boo, nga mundu jokapi jojuigali mu kilongu saka Sauli? Ana jubii mbala nunhengila uamboni waka Sapanga.” Siba jwajibua, “Jubii mwana waka Yonasani, lakini jombi kilema jwa magolu.” <verse eid="2SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Bambu nkolongu anndalukia, “Boo, jubii kwako?” Siba anzibua, “Jubii kunyumba kwaka Makili mwana waka Amieli ku Lo Debali.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ndi Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaatuma bandu, najombi jwaletwa kuhuma kunyumba jaka Makili mwana waka Amieli ku Lo Debali.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ndienu, Mefibosheti mwana waka Yonasani jojuwe nsokoo waka Sauli jwajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaabuka nukupega magoti palongi jaka bambu nkolongu Daudi nu kujinama mbaka pai. Daudi ankema “Mefibosheti.” Najombi jwajibua, “Ena! Nepani nu ntumisi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi ampwagila, “Wiijogopa. Nepani naguhengila ga amboni kwa ndaba ja atati baku Yonasani. Matui goti gagabia gaka Sauli ahoku baku niitenda kugukelabuki. Na wehapa masoba goha wiikula pamu na nepani.” <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai nu kupwaaga, “Nepani nengana pe na jimbwa jejiwii, ndaba jakii gunhenge haga?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ndienu Bambu nkolongu Daudi ankema Siba ntumisi waka Sauli nu kumpwagi, “Mali goti gagabia gaka Sauli na alongu baki numpeki nsokoo waka bambu nkolongu waku. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Wehapa na bana baku na atumisi baku mwiibia munndeme Mefibosheti na mwiibia munndete ilebi ili nsokoo waka bambu waku jubia na posu masoba goha. Lakini jombi jwiikula pamu na nepani.” Kipindi sehesi Siba jwabia na bana akanalomi komi nu nhwanu na atumisi ishilini.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ndienu, Siba ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Nepani nuntumisi waku niihenga goha kulengana na malagalaki gaku.” Ndienu Mefibosheti jwabia jupata posu jaki pamesa jaka Daudi ngati jumu kati ja bana baka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti jwabii na mwana nsoku mwanalomi jobunkema Mika. Bandu boti bikilongu saka Siba babia atumisi baka Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Henu Mefibosheti jojwabii julemii magolu gaki goha jwabia jutama ku musi uku Yelusalemu nu kupata posu jaki pamesa jaka bambu nkolongu masoba goti.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jwaawesa Aamoli na Aashulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1Majambu gi Ipindi 19:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Egapeta majambu haga bambu nkolongu Nahashi juku Amoli jwatenda kuwa, na mwana waki jobunkema Hanuni jwabia bambu nkolongu baada ja atati baki. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi japwaaga, “Nanhengila gaamboni Hanuni mwana waka Nahashi ngati atati baki hebanhengila nepani.” Ndi Daudi jwaatuma bandu kumpeke poli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Nabombi bandu baka Daudi bala pabahika mu nndema wa Aamoli, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />akakilongosi ba Aamoli bumpwagila Hanuni bambu nkolongu wabu, “Boo, guwasali Daudi kukutumi bandu bukuhika kugupeke poli jwaatende isima atati bako? Boo, Daudi ngasejwaatuma bandu haba kwaku ili kulingali nu kulaluki majambu ga musi gongo ndi mwenikatai jwaakoma bandu bake?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ndienu Hanuni jwaajukua bandu bajwaatumiki Daudi bala nukummoga kila jumu nusu ji indeu yaki nukuijendu ingobu yabu pikilanda mbaka mu kibunu nakwaaleka ajenda. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Babona iyoni ngamaa kubuja kunyumba jabu. Najombi bambu nkolongu jwaapwagila, “Ntama kumusi guku Yeliku mbaka paimela indeu ndi mwiibuja kunyuma jino.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Aamoni pababona atei kunsukisa Daudi, baakoka akomana ngondu elupu ishilini biki Alamu baajenda kwa magolu kuuma ku Beti Lehobu nuku Soba na akomana ngondu elupu komi na abeli kuhuma ku Tobu na bambu nkolongu Maaka koni jubii na akomana ngondu elupu jimu. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Najombi Daudi pajowana majambu haga antuma Yoabu na akomana ngondu na baabii na makili kujenda kukomana. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Aamoni bapita boti nu kulipanga ili kukomana pu nndyangu wa musi uku Raba musi wabu nkolongu, nabombi Aalamu kuhuma ku Soba nuku Leobu na bandu kuhuma ku Tobu na bambu nkolongu Maaka bilipangiki ku lungwenza.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu pajwabona ngondu jibii ngolongu ngani kulongi nu kunyuma, jwaahagula akomana ngondu bangi buku Izilaeli baabii na makili gu kukomana na Aalamu. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Akomana ngondu bangi bala babahigali jwaabeka pai ju ulongosi waka nndongu mundu Abishai, najombi jwaapanga ili kukomana na Aamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu ampwagila Abishai, “Ana Aalamu biitenda kunapu wiinyangatia ana Aamoni biitenda kugulapu niitenda kugujangati. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Lakini gulipekia makili na tukomana sanalomi kwa ndaba ja bandu bitu na kwa ndaba ja misi jaka bambu Sapanga witu na bambu Sapanga jutuhengila lejubona laamboni kwaki.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ndienu, Yoabu na bandu baki bajenda kulongi kukomana na Aalamu, nabombi Aalamu batenda kutila. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Aamoni pababona Aalamu atei kutila nabombi kabee buntila Abishai nu kujingi kumusi. Yoabu jwakotuka kukomana na Aamoni jwabuja ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Lakini Aalamu pababona Aizilaeli baawesiki, bilikusanya pamu. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeli jwaalagalakia Aalamu bababia kwii ja losi Eufulati baaleta ili baapelika ku Helamu koni alongoswa na Shobaki nkolongu jwaakomana ngondu baka Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi pajwamanya jwaakusanya Aizilaeli boa pamu nukulomboka losi Yoludani nukujenda mbaka ku Elamu. Nabombi Aalamu bilipangiki kukomana na Daudi batumbulia kukomana naku. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Lakini Aalamu batila palongi ja Aizilaeli. Daudi jwaakoma na Aalamu mia saba bababia ahendesa magali gukukomane na baakwelale falasi elupu alubaini. Kabee anhumisi Shobaki nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu babu najombi jwakuwa apalapala. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Aka bambu akolongu boti bababia atumisi baka Hadadezeli pababona kubanga asindwiki bajetanganinya ku lukwali na Aizilaeli nabombi babia atumisi ba Aizilaeli. Ndi Aalamu ngasebaajangatiya kabee Aamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Betisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Muutumbuli wa saka akabambu akolongu pababoka kujenda ku kukomana ngondu, Daudi antuma Yoabu pamu na bandu baka bambu nkolongu na akomana ngondu boti buku Izilaeli. Baakoma Aamoni nukwaayongolota akomana ngondu ba musi uku Laba. Lakini Daudi jwaigali ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Lisoba limu pakamii, Daudi jwajumuka pikitanda nukujenda pikipagaa sa nyumba jaki ju ubambu nkolongu. Pajwabia jujenda kunani kola, ammbona mmbomba jumu juoga masi, mmbomba hoju jwabia junyambiki ngamaa. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Ndienu, Daudi jwaatuma mundu kulaluki mbomba hoju ndi nyane. Mundu jola ampwagila Daudi, “Mmbomba we hoju bunkema Batisheba mwana waka Elia kabee nhwanu waka Ulia Nhiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ndienu Daudi jwaatuma bandu bukunzukua. Ndienu Batisheba jwahika kwaka Daudi, najombi Daudi jwagonila nu mmbomba, mmbomba hoju jwabia juhumiki pe kujomo masoba gaki gukutumii, ndienu jwabuja kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Mmbomba jola jwapata kitumbu najombi atuma mundu kwaka Daudi kumpwagi jubii ni kitumbu saki.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ndienu, Daudi antuma mundu kwaka Yoabu kumpwagi, “Ntuma Ulia nhiti kwangu nepane.” Najombi Yoabu antuma Ulia kwaka Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ulia pajwahika kwaki Daudi, Daudi anndalukia Yoabu kupete ngondu namuna hejiendale. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Ndi Daudi ampwagila Ulia, “Gubuja kunyumba jaku wakasamba magolu gaku.” Ulia jwapita kunyumba jaka bambu nkolongu ni kipindi sehesi bambu nkolongu ampelakia nhupi. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Lakini Hulia ngasejwakelabwiki kunyumba jake ila jwagonila pamu na atumisi baka bambu nkolongu waki pilitanga la nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daudi pabumpwagila kubanga Ulia ngasejwapiti kunyumba jaki, Daudi ampwagila Ulia, “Wehapa guhumiki mu sapwali ndaba jaki ngasewapiti kunyumba jako?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ulia anzibua Daudi, “Lisanduku li Lilaganu pamu na akomana ngondu boha buku Izilaeli nuku Yuda atama mu indamba ku ngondu. Kilongosi wangu Yoabu pamu na atumisi baki boha atemi kambi kulukoba, boo, sapi lee nepani nyenda kunyumba nakakula na kunywa nukugone nu nhwanu wango? Ngati hegutama na loho jaku hejitama nganhengi sindu ngati hese.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Ndienu, Daudi ampwagila Ulia, “Nala gutama pamba lelenu kabee ni kilabu naguleka gubuja.” Ndi Ulia jwahigali mu Musi uku Yelusalemu lisoba heli. Lisoba lelapwata, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi ankoka Ulia kula na kunywa kunyumba jaki ila jwagoluka pikiteu pamu na atumisi baka bambu nkolongu waki.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Pulukela Daudi anhandakiya Yoabu balua nukumpeke ulia juipelika kwaka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mubalua heji Daudi jwaandiki ana, “Ummbeka Ulia pu nsitali wa palongi pandu papabi na ngondu ngolongu namangani ndi wanndeka kola ili bunndapula jukua.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Ndi Yoabu pajwabia juguyongolota musi ammbeka Ulia pandu papuje jwaamanyiki akomana ngondu ba abaja babii bana makili ngamaa. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Bandu ba musi hogu baboka mu musi wabu nu kukomana na Yoabu. Atumisi bangi baka Daudi batenda kuwa. Ulia Nhiti najombi jatenda kuwa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Ndi Yoabu anndandila Daudi goa haga pamu nagagahengika ku ngondu. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu anndagalakia ntumisi joantumiki jola ana, “Baada jukunndandi bambu nkolongu majambu goa guku ngondu, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />ana juyomiki nukugulaluki, ‘Ndaba jaki mwajenda pambipi na musi pamwabia atenda kukomana? Ngasemwamanyiki bakabia anndapwi mikoa kuhuma mu lumatu lwa musi wabo? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Nya joankoma Abimeleki mwana waka Yelubesheti? Boo, ngase jwabii mmbomba jumu kumusi uku Tebesi jojuwe jwalekala lilibu lukupole kuhuma mu lumatu nalombi lunkoma Abimeleke? Ndaba jaki henu mwajenda pambipi nu lumato?’ Nala wehapa wampwagila ana, ‘Ata ntumisi waku nhiti Ulia najombi jutei kuwa.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Mundu jola jwajenda kwaka Daudi nu kumpwagi goa gaantuma Yoabu jupwaga. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Mundu jola ampwagila Daudi, “Abaja bitu babia na makili kupeta twepani, bapita kunza ja misi nu kutulapu kulungwenza. Hata hela twepani twaabenga mbaka ku litanga la musi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ndi butulapula ni mikowa twepani twaatumisi baku kuhuma mu lumatu. Atumisi baku bangi batenda kuwa. Ata ntumisi waku Ulia Nhiti najombi juwii.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi ampwagila mundu jola, “Wampwagila Yoabu ana, ‘Lijambu lende lagusumbu ndaba kuwa ngasekuhagula, ngondu jiwesa kunkoma jokapi. Ila gubeka malapuli ku musi mbaka gukoma bandu ba musi hogu.’ Ukumpwagila hela Yoabu ili kungamalisa mwoju Yoabu.” <verse eid="2SA 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Betisheba nhwanu waka Ulia pajwajowana Ulia nndomi waki jutei kuwa jwatenda kunndelila nndomi waki. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Kipindi sukunndele nndomi waki pawajomuka Daudi jwalagalakia Betisheba bukunzukua nukumpeleka kunyumba jaki. Betisheba jwabia henu nhwanu waka Daudi najombi ambelakia mwana mwanalomi. Lakini lijambu leheli lejwahenga Daudi lunhenga Bambu Sapanga jusukila.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Natani anndakali Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Ndi Bambu Sapanga antuma nndota waka Sapanga Natani kwaka Daudi. Natani anzendila Daudi nukumpwagi, “Kwabia na akanalomi abeli musi gumu, jumu jwabia na mali gingi najongi jwabia kapuku. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Jojubii na mali gingi jola jwabia na makondoo gingi na ng'ombi ingipi. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Lakini kapuku jola jwabia na kakondoo kasoku kamu kambomba, kajwabia jutei kukalomba. Jukatunziki nakombi katenda kukola mu nyumba jaki pamu na bana baki. Julilea libana lilikondoo lela posu ngati hejukula mweni nu kunywele masi mukikombi saki nukuntoto mu kigamba saki. Libana lilikondoo lela labia ngati kamwali kwaka mundu kapuku jola. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Lisoba limu mundu jojubii na hindu hingi jola, jwabii nungeni kunyumba jaki. Ndi mundu jwana mali gingi jola ngasejwapai kujuku likondoo laki limu au ng'ombi jaki ili kunsinzi nngeni waki ila jwajenda kunnyaga mundu kapuku jola likondoo laki nukunsinzi nngeni waki.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi pajwajowana jwapata inyela nu kumpwagi nndota waka Sapanga Natani, “Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi kubanga mundu jojutei lijambu heli kupalika jukuwaje.”<verse eid="2SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />“Kupalika anndepa kapuku jola likondoo heli mala pasesi ndaba juhengiki lijambu lilia na ngasejwabii ni ikia!”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Natani ampwagila Daudi, “Wehapa ndi mundu hojo! Henu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga juku Izilaeli jupwaga ana, ‘Nepani nugujakani mahuta ili gubia wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli nu kuguoko mu maboku gaka Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nugupeki nyumba jaka bambu waku na aka ahanu baki abia baku kabe nugupeki bandu buku Izilaeli na bandu baka Yuda ili gwaalongusa. Ana goti haga ganuguhengi gakabia masoku kwaku nakabia nugujonzuki mala pabeli kabee kupeta haga. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ndaba jaki henu gulilongimi lilobi langu nepani bambu Sapanga nukuhenga ubaja ago palongi jango? Unkomiki Ulia Nhiti ku upanga nu kunzuku nhanamundu na kuba nhwanu waku. Waatumia Ahamoni kunkoma Ulia ku ngondu! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Henu, ndaba gutei kunongama na gunzukwi nhwanu waka Ulia Nhiti kuba nhwanu waku, kuwa kwa bandu ngakwiiboki mu kibeleku saku.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Jowana, Bambu Sapanga jupwaga, ‘Linga niileta mang'aliku mu kibeleku saku wamweti. Niijukua aka ahanu baku koni gulinga kwa miu gaku nu kumpeke wapambipi waku najombi jwiigonila naku pangwendu. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Wehapa wahenga lijambu heli kwa sili lakini nepani niihenga lijambu heli palongi ja Aizilaeli boha pangwendu.’”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ndi Daudi ampwagila Natani, “Nunhengi mahakau Bambu Sapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natani ampwagila, “Bambu Sapanga jugulekaki mahakau gaku na wehapa ngagukuwe. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Hata hela seguhengiki hesi, gunndongimi Bambu Sapanga, mwana waku jowipapa jwiitenda kuwa.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Ndienu, Natani jwatenda kubuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana waka Daudi jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi andoba Sapanga mwana juwesa kulama. Jwajenda kusumba saki na kelukelu jwagoni pai. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Aseja bababia anndingali mu nyumba jela bumpwata nu kunndoba jujumuka lakini jwombi jwatenda kukana na ngasejwali posu jokapi pamu na bombi. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Palapeta lijuma limu mwana jola jwatenda kuwa. Atumisi baka Daudi bajogupa kumpwagi kubanga mwana juwii, ndaba bawasalia, “Mwana jola pajwabia mwomi twalongila najombi lakini ngasejutujowanile. Henu twampwagila boo ana mwana we jola juwii? Pangi juwesa kulikoma.” <verse eid="2SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi pajwabona atumisi baki atenda kubolane jwamanya kubanga mwana juwii. Ndi jwaalalukia, “Boo, mwana juwiile?” Nabombi bunzibua, “Hena juwile.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Ndipala, Daudi jwajumuka kuhuma pai, nu kuoga masi nu kulipaki mauta nu kuwata ingobu yaki yengi. Nukujenda mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga nu kulumbali. Ndi jwabuja kunyumba na pajwapala posu, bupekia najwombi jwatenda kula. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Ndipala atumisi baki bunndaluki, Henu gutei kike? Mwana pajwabi mwomi wehapa wakotuka kula nukunndele. Lakini pajuwii gujumwiki na kula posu.<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi jwaajibwa, “Sakaka mwana pajwabi mwomi nakotuka kula nukulela. Nahenga hela ndaba nawasalia, ‘Nya jojumanya? Pangi Bambu Sapanga jwakawesa kunekake mahakau ili mwana juendalia kuba mwomi.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Lakini henu juwii ndaba jakii ngotuka kula? Boo, nepani nhwesa kunkelabu punndema kabete? Lisoba limu niijenda kojupiti hoku, lakini jombi ngajuwesi kuhika komi kone.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusaliwa kwaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Ndienu, Daudi ampolisa moju Betisheba nhwanu waki. Jwagonila naku najombi jwapata kitumbu nukupapa mwana mwanalomi, jojuwe Daudi ankema Solomoni. Bambu Sapanga ampai ngamaa mwana we jola, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />najombi antuma Natani nndota waka Sapanga kwaka Daudi jujenda kumpwagi ankema mwana jola, Yedidia mana jaki jubii ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi jugukamu musi uku Laba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1Majambu gi Ipindi 20:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Kipindi sehesi Yoabu jugulapula musi uku Laba wa aka Aamoni najombi jugukamula musi ukibambu hogu. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu jwatuma bandu kwaka Daudi kupwaga, “Nugulapwii musi uku Laba na nilikamwi litanda labu la masi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Henu waakusanya bandu boti baahigali ubeka likambi kuyongalota nu kugukamu. Ana nugukamwi nenga nagukema liina langu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ndi Daudi jwaakusanya bandu boti nukujenda ku Laba, juulapula musi gola nu kugukamu. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Ndienu jwajukua litaji laka bambu nkolongu wabu kuuma pikimutu saki. Kutopa kulitaji la zaabu heli kwabia kilu selasini nunhwanu nu nkati jaki kwabia nililibu labei ngolongu. Najombi Daudi bunhwatika litaji lela pikimutu saki. Kabe jwanyaga hindu hingi ngama mu musi hogu. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Ndienu jwaajukua bandu ba musi hogu nakwaabeka ahenga lihengu kukutumi misumenu na sululu yikisomasoma na mapengu gikisomasoma na kwaatumi ahenga lihengu mulitanuli la matipwali, hela ndi hejujihenga misi joka ja Ahamoli. Egapeta haga Daudi na bandu boti babuja ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amunoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abusolomu jwabii nu ndombu waki jobunkema Tamali. Ndi kwaika kipindi Amunoni mwana jongi mwanalomi waka Daudi ampala ngamaa Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amunoni jwang'aliki ngamaa mbaka julikopakia jutenda kulwala ndaba juku ndombu waki Tamali, ndaba Tamali jwabi kamwali jwanga kummanya mwanalomi, na kwabonikana lijambu langa kuwesikana kwaka Amunoni kuhenge sindu sokapi jwombi. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Lakini Amunoni jwabia nunkosi waki jobunkema Yonadabu, mwana waka Shamu nndongu waka Daudi. Yonadabu jwabia mundu jojubii nuumanyi ngamaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu ampwagila Amunoni, “Wehapa wamwana waka bambu nkolongu, ndaba jaki gutenda kukombala na gubonikana ngasegutogule kila lisoba? Ndaba jaki ngasegupala kumbwagila.” Amunoni, ampwagila “Numpala Tamali ndombu uku nndongu wangu Abusolomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu ampwagila, “Weapa uligonika pikitanda ulikopakia gunngonzu. Atati baku pabiika kugubona undoba, ‘Ndagalakia dada wangu Tamali juhika junetila libumunda nhwesa kula na junhandalia posu palongi jangu koni nijibona na mweti na junea posu jeheji.’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ndienu Amunoni jwaendalia kugone pikitanda, koni jukopake jutenda kulwala. Bambu nkolongu ejajenda kumbona, Amunoni ampwagila, “Nuguloba kumpwagila Tamali dada wangu juhika pamba jundelakia posu kasokopi koni nundingalila, na mweni juneyaje.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ndi Daudi ampwagila Tamali jujenda kunyumba juku nhwasa waki Amunoni akuntelakia posu. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Ndienu Tamali jwajendakola anketania Amunoni jugoni. Jwajukua uwembi nukuuhunya nukuntelake posu palongi jaka Amunoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Posu je jela pajabia jikupiki, Tamali jujipia mu supulia. Nukumpelake Amunoni lakini Amunoni jwakana kula, jwapwaga kila mundu jupita kunza na boti bapita kunza. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ndienu Amunoni ampwagila Tamali, “Henu gunetila posu jeheji mu sumba sango nu gunea.” Tamali jwajukua posu jela nukugapeleka kusumba suku nhwasa waki Amunoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Pajwabia ampeke poso jela, Amunoni ankamula nukumpwagi, “Guika gugonila nanepani.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Lakini Tamali ampwagila, “Ngahela nhwasa wango wiinasimisa. Lijambu ngati ale ngase lihengeka mu nndema wa Izilaele. Wiihenga lijambu liking'ang'a alele. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Kuupandi wangu nepani nganhwesi kuinakali iyoni ayeye. Nu kuupandi waku wehapa wiibia jumu kati ja bandu ang'ang'a munndema wa Izilaeli. Henu, nuguloba gulongila na bambu nkolongu ndaba ngajukukani kunyuku mia nu nhanu wako.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Lakini Amunoni ngasejwapala kunzowane na ndaba jwabii na makili kupeta jombi ankamula nukunndimba.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ndienu Amunoni ansuki Tamali ngamaa. Ansukia Tamali kupeta eampala puutumbuli, Ampwagila Tamali, “Boka pamba.”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali anzibua, “Ngahela nhwasa wango, ubaja nkolongu go guhenga gukumenga nepani ndi ukolongu ngani kupeta go gunhengiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Lakini Amunoni ngasejwapala kunzowane. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ankema nkombu waki jojwabia joantumakia nukumpwagi, “Mpia mbomba ajo palongi jangu. Nu nndyangu ugupunga nikipanda.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Amunoni nu nkombu jola bumpiya nu kugupunga nndyangu kukipanda. Tamali jwabia juweti ingobu nasu jejibii na maboku malasu ndaba hela ndi heakubika awata bana baka bambu nkolong akakamwali. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Ndi Tamali julipakia maliu kukimutu nukulipapu lingobu laki nukubeka maboku gaki kukimutu, ndi jwaboka koni julela kwa sauti. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Abusolomu nhwasa waki paambona andalukia Tamali, “Boo, Amunoni nhwasa waku jugoni nawehapa? Gutumbala nndombu wango. Jombi ndi nhwasa waku. Walibeka lijambu heli mu mwoju waku.” Ndi Tamali jwatama mu nyumba jaka Abusalomu koni jubii nu usungu nukulibona jubii kanzika jaki. <verse eid="2SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi pajwajowana lijambu heli jwayomiki ngamaa. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abusoloni ansuki Amunoni ngamaa hata ngasejwabia julonge nako, ndaba akamula nndombu waki Tamali nukunndimba.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusolomu julepa kisasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Eyabiya ipetiki yaka ibeli Abusolomu jwabia na lihengu lu kuseku makondoo gaki mangoma ku musi uku Baali Hasoli, pambipi nu mpaka nuku Efulaimu. Jwaakoka bana boti baka bambu nkolongu akanalomi. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abusolomu anzendila bambu nkolongu Daudi nukumpwagi, “Linga nepani ntumisi waku nenzeku makondoo gaku mangoma. Nuguloba wa bambu pamu na atumisi baku, nnzenda pamu nanepani, ntumisi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Bambu nkolongu jwajibua, “Ngahela mwanawango twiijenda twaboha, twiikuba nsigu kwaku.” Hata ngati Abusolomu jwaendalia kunndoba jujenda lakini bambu jwatenda kukana jwatenda kumpenge.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ndienu Abusolomu ampwagila, “Ana ngagujendi nala gunndeka nndonguwangu Amunoni tujenda najombi.” Bambu nkolongu jwajibua, “Lakini ndaba jakii jujenda pamu na mwanganya?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Lakini Abusolomu jwaendalia kunndobalake, na mwisu wee bambu nkolongu Amunoni na bana baki bangi ajenda ku tipati heji. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abusolomu jwaapwagila atumisi baki, “Munndingalia Amnoni pajwibia jukunywiki divai nukulobee nakanopi. Panampwagila, ‘Munndapula Amunoni,’ mwankoma. Ganiaga ndi malagalaki gangu kwinu mwanganya. Mwiijogopa na mmbia na makili.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ndienu atumisi baka Abusalomu bunhengila Amunoni ngati hebabia alagalakiwi na Abusolomu ndi bana akanalomi bangi baka bambu nkolongu batenda kuboka kila jumu jwakwela kinyama saki sebikikema nyumbu nukutila.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Pababia bakona mwiindela, Daudi jwamanya kubanga Abusolomu jwaakomiki bana baki boti ngasejuigali hata jumu. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwajumuka nukujendu mangobu gaki kuusungu nukugone pai. Hata na atumisi baki boti bababia ajemi pambipi najombi bajendula mangobu gabu. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Lakini Yonadabu, mwana waka Shimea nndongu waka Daudi ampwagila, “Bambu wangu jwiiwasali kubanga bana baki boa atei kwaakoma. Amunoni kajikajaki ndi jobunkomiki. Majambu haga Abusalomu jwapangi kugahenga toka kipindi Amunoni paandimbiki Tamali nndombu waki. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Henu wabambu wangu wiiwasali mu mwoju waku kubanga bana baku boti atei kuwa. Amunoni kajika jaki ndi jobunkomiki.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Lakini Abusalomu jwabia jutiliki. Najwombi nkombu jojwabia zamu jaki juulonda apalapa jwabona likundi la bandu ahika kuumi ku kitombi muindela jukuumi ku Holonaimu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Lingalia bambu nkolongu, bana baku aika ngati henugupwagi nepani ntumisi waku.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Ntumisi jola pajajomula pe kulonge bana akanalomi baka bambu nkolongu batenda kujingi, batumbulia kulela kwa sauti. Bambu nkolongu na bandu boti batumbulia kulela kuusungu.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Lakini Abusalomu jwatilila kwaka Talimai mwana waka Amihudi bambu nkolongu wa musi uku Geshuli. Bambu nkolongu Daudi andelila mwana waki Amunoni kwa masoba gingipi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abusolomu jwatilila kumusi uku Geshuli, jwatama kola kwa yaka itatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Baada jaka bambu nkolongu Daudi kutuli kupete kuwa kwaka Amunoni mwanawaki, jwatumbulia kutokule kummbona mwanawaki Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu jupanga kunkelabu abusalumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana waka Seluya jwamanyiki kubanga mwoju waka Daudi gubii kwaka Abusalomu pee. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ndi jwaatuma bandu ku Tekoa ili buntaputa mmbomba jojubii na malangu. Pabunndeta ampwagila, “Likopakia gubii ni kilelu. Guwata ingobu yukulobalake kilelu, wiipaka mauta ila gulihenga ngati mmbomba jojubii kukilelu sa masoba gingi. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Ndi gujenda kwaka bambu nkolongu ukumpwagila ganugupwagi.” Ndi Yoabu ampwagila malobi gukumpwagi bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mmbomba jola juku Tekoa jwajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai palongi jaka bambu nkolongu nukumpwagi, “Mwa bambu nkolongu pepakoku na nnyangatile.”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Gubii na shida boo?” Mmbomba jola jwajibua, “Nandi alomi bangu atei kuwa. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Nabi na bana akanalomi abeli. Lisoba limu pababia kulungwenza batumbulia kukomana. Na ngasejwabii mundu jokapi jwakwakengale jumu andapula nzaki nu kunkoma. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Henu alongu bangu boti atei kung'anambuka nepani ntumisi waku, apala naapekia bombi mwana joankomiki nzaki ili bunkoma ndaba junkomiki nndongu waki. Henu bankoma hoju jojuwe ndi nndisi. Ana ahengiki hela biibia ahoiki mwana jonunhobale jojuigali nu nndomi wangu nga bunndeke mwana punndema.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila mmbomba jola, “Gukelabuka kunyumba jaku lijambu laku nilagalakia agujangatia.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Mmbomba jojuhuma ku tekoa jola jwapwaga, “Bambu nkolongu wangu ana liipitila likosa lokapi liibia panani jangu nepani na panani ja alongu bangu baatati bangu. Ndienu wehapa nu ubambu ukolongu waku ngamwiikubi nilikosa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Mundu jokapi ana jugujogwi wanndeta kwangu nepani na ngajwiiki kugusumbu kabete.” <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Pepakoku bambu nkolongu, nandi gunobila kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, ili nndongu wangu jola jojupala kulepa kisasi sukunkoma mwana wangu jwiihenga likosa lengi likolongu lukunkoma mwana wangu jonge.” Bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila, “Nugulapi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga nga likubi hata lijunzu laka mwana waku limu leliabuka pai.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Mbomba jola ampwagila, “Nuguloba nepani ntumisi waku gunyetakalia mbwaga lilobi limu kwaku bambu nkolongu.” Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Pwagaje.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Mbomba jola ampwagila, “Ndaba jaki henu gupangiki ubaja gongo kwa bandu baka Sapanga?” Kulengana nu kuamu kwaku lijambu heli wamweti, gutei kulitemu kubanga gubii ni likosa, ndaba ngase gunndekake mwana waku jubuja kunyumba kuhuma kojutili. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Twepani twaboha lasima twiitenda kuwa. Twepani tubii ngati masi gagajitiki pai gaguge ngasegajoleka. Hata Sapanga ngase ngaseampendale mundu jonzo na mundu jongi, ila jwombi julenganake indela ili jwobummbengiki jwiigali kuba mundu jojutilatila.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />“Nepani nhikiki kulonge nawehapa wa bambu nkolongu wangu ndaba atei kunyogo. Ndienu nepani ntumisi waku nawasali, ‘Nambanga nakalongila na bambu nkolongu kwajwiindimisia ganagapala nepani ntumisi waki. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Pengi bambu nkolongu jwiitenda kunyowane nu kunhoko mu maboku gaka mundu jojupala kungoma nepani pamu na mwana wangu kuhuma mu ulisi waka Sapanga.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Nanepani ntumisi waku nawasalia kubanga, ‘Lilobi laka bambu wangu liimbekia lukwali mu mwojuwango, ndaba wa bambu nkolongu wangu gubii ngati atumi baka Sapanga bukunani guwesa kumanya majambu gaamboni na gilia. Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jubia pamu nawehapa.’”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Ndi Bambu nkolongu anzibua mmbomba jola, “Winhia lijambu lokapi lenagulalukia.” Mbomba jola jwapwaga, “Pwaga bambu nkolongu wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Bambu nkolongu anndalukia, “Boo, Yoabu juhusika mu lijambu hele?” Mbomba jola jwapwaga, “Napa palongi jaku wabambu nkolongu mundu ngakuwesa kujepe upande wa kwamalele au upandi wa kwamangega kupete lijambu legupwagiki wabambu nkolongu wangu. Yoabu ntumisi waku ndi jojundumiki. Jwombi ndi jojumbwagi malobi goti haga ganugupwagi nepani ntumisi waku. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu jwahengiki hela ili kubadilisa majambu. Lakini wehapa wabambu wangu gubi na malangu ngati ga atumi bukunani kwaka Sapanga hata guwesa kumanya majambu goha gagabii punndema.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Ndi bambu nkolongu ampwagila Yoabu, “Henu gujowana mbia luusa ili gunkelabua kunyumba nkombu Abusalomu jola.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu jwapega magoti nukujinamana mbaka pai nukundobe bambu nkolongu mbenge koni jupwaga, “Lelenu nepani ntumisi waku bambu nkolongu wangu mbatiki uwaamboni palongi jaku ndaba gujetaki kuloba kwangu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ndi Yoabu, jwaboka nukujenda ku Geshuli kunkelabu Abusalomu ku musi uku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Lakini bambu nkolongu jwapwaga, “Abusalomu jutamaa kutali nanepani, jutama kunyumba jaki. Jwiika nu kumona.” Ndi Abusalomu jwakuba jutama kutali nu kunyumba jaki na ngaseambona bambu nkolongu Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu na bambu nkolongu Daudi atenda kujongana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mu Izilaeli joka nga mundu jojwabia junyambiki ngati Abusalomu. Toka mu lwaji yaki mbaka kukimutu saki, Abusalomu ngasejwabia na kasolu jokapi. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Majunzu gaki gabia gakendiki na jukubika juseku kila saka mala jimu pagakuba malasu na gagatopiki pajugapemika kutopakwaki kwabia kilu ibeli kulengana niipemu ikibambu. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abusalomu jabelaka bana atatu akanalomi pamu nu mbomba jumwa lihina laki Tamali. Tamali jwabii kamwali jojunyambiki ngani.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Ndienu, Abusalomu jwatama mu musi uku Yelusalemu kwa yaka ibeli sanga kubonana na bambu nkolongu Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ndienu, Abusalomu jwaatuma bandu kwaka Yoabu, ili ajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu badala jaki, lakini Yoabu jwatenda kukana. Abusalomu jwaatuma bandu bangi kabee, lakini Yoabu jwatenda kukana. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ndienu, Abusalomu jwaapwagila atumisi baki, “Ndinga Yoabu jubii ni lituhi li inganu pa mbipi ni lituhi langu. Nzendania mkalijosa mwotu.” Ndienu atumisi baka Yoabu bajenda kulijosa mwotu lituhi laka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu jwajenda kunyumba jaka Abusalomu nukundaluki, “Ndaba jaki atumisi baku ajosiki mwotu lituhi lango?” <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abusalomu anzibua, “Linga naatuma bandu kwaku ili guhika kongo ili nugutuma kwaka bambu nkolongu ukundalukia, ‘Ndaba jaki mokiki ku Geshule? Kukabiya sapi kwangu kuhigali hoku’. Henu gunyangatia ili nhwesa kumbona bambu nkolongu. Ana mii ni likosa, henu jwakangomaje!” <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ndienu Yoabu jwajenda kumpwagi bambu nkolongu malobi haga goti, na jwombi ankema Abusalomu, najwombi jwajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu, jwagonila nulutumbu palongi jaka bambu nkolongu. Na bambu nkolongu jwatenda kumbusu Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu jupanga kung'anambuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Egapeta majambu haga Abusalumu jwapata ligali na falasi na bandu hamsini bukunndongule. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abusalomu jwayobali kujumuka lukela ngani nukujenda kujema kwi indela jejijenda ku litanga la musi. Mundu jokapi jojwabia na magambu ga jupala gajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu ili jutemula, Abusolumu ankema mundu hoju pulutengu nukunndaluki, “Guhumi musi bole?” Ana mundu hoju jupwagiki juhumi musi gumu gulikabila luku Izilaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abusalomu ampwagi, “Segulaja sasakaka. Lakini nga mundu jokapi jojuaguliwi na bambu nkolongu kugujowane.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Kabe Abusolumu apwagi, “Ana nepani nakabia nhamusi juku Izilaeli! Kila mundu jojulaja au jojubii na majambu jwakahika kwangu nanepani nakabia numpeki sejupalika kupata!” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Kabee Abusalomu jwatondabia kuboku kwaki nu kukumbati nu kumbusu mundu jokapi jojwahika kupega magoti nukunzina mi mbaka pai. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Hela ndi Abusalomu hejwahengila Aizilaeli boha babahika kupala kutemuliwa magambu gabu kwaka bambu nkolongu. Kukuhenga hela Abusalomu jujikamwii mioju ja Aizilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Baada ja yaka nsesi Abusalomu ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Pepa koku na unekake nyenda ku Hebroni ili kupia senunndagila Bambu Sapanga kubanga niitenda kupia. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Ndaba nepani ntumisi waku panabia ndama ku Geshuli ku Alamu nunndagila Bambu Sapanga kubanga ana Bambu Sapanga jwiingelabua ku musi uku Yelusalemu ndi nanndumbalia jombi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila “Nala jenda kulukwali,” Abusalomu jwaboka nu kujenda ku Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Lakini Abusalumu jwatuma bandu kwa sili mu makabila goha guku Izilaeli kupwaga, “Pamwijowana pee sauti ja talumbeta, mwiipwaga, ‘Abusalomu ndi bambu nkolongu mu Hebuloni!’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abusoloni pajwajenda ku Hebuloni jwapiti na bandu mia ibeli bajwaakoka kuhuma ku Yelusalemu nabombi bajenda kola kwa mwoju wa sapi wala ngasebamanyiki mpangu waka Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Abusalomu pajwabia jupia litambiku jwatuma mundu ku musi uku gilu kunkema Aitofeli na Mgilo na jojwabia apeke mawasu bambu nkolongu Daudi. Kupala kung'anambuka Daudi kwaka Abusalomu kwaendalia kupata makili na bandu bababia atenda kunzengale batenda kujonzukeka.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Daudi jutila ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />“Mundu jumu jwaika nukumpwagi Daudi, bandu buku Izilaeli jiutwa na Abusalomu!” <verse eid="2SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ndi, Daudi jwaapwagila atumisi baki bajwabia naku ku musi uku Yelusalemu, “Nzumuka tutila ana nga hela ngatuwesi kunzepa Abusalomu. Tutenda nyata tubokaje jwiika kutulete mangaliku na kwaakoma bandu ba musi kwa mapanga.” <verse eid="2SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Lakini atumisi baki bumpwagila, “Twepani twaatumisi baku bambu witu nkolongu tubi tayali kuhenga lokapi lewiamula.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ndi bambu nkolongu jwaboka pamu na alongu baki lakini jwagaleka mabangu gaki komi koni gahenga lihengu la panyumba. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Bambu nkolongu jwaboka pamu na bandu baki boti koni atenda kumpwata bajema pandu papabii patali kidogu. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Atumisi boha baka bambu mkolongu na Akileti boti na Apeleti boti pamu na Agiti miasita babumpwa bambu nkolongu Daudi kuhuma ku musi uku Gati baboka pamu na jombi koni atenda kunndongule.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ndi bambu nkolongu paambona Itai kilongosi jwa akomana ngondu buku Gati andalukia, “Ndaba jakii hata wehapa gubokiki pamu na twepane? Gukelabuka wakatama pamu na bambu nkolongu nkombu hojo. Ndaba wehapa kongo gungene kabe gutiliki kuhuma ku nndema ukunyumba jino. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Guhikiki pamba kipindi kisokopi pena sekipetiki. Boo, nuguhenga lee kuba wamundu jukuyongolota pamu natwepane koni ngasemanyiki konyenda? Gubuja kunyumba pamu na alongu bako. Na Bambu Sapanga jwagulangia uwamboni waki nu kuobaleka kwaki.” <verse eid="2SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Lakini Itai anzibua bambu nkolongu, “Napa palongi jaka bambu Sapanga na wehapa bambu nkolongu wangu pokapi pawiibia kukubi kuwa au kuendale kutama nepani nuntumisi waku niitenda kuba.” <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Ndi Daudi ampwgila Itai, “Nala jenda longulia kulongi.” Ndi Itai Mgiti jwapeta jombi pamu na bana baki. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi pajwabia jutenda kupeta pamu na bandu baki bandu boti mu musi woti balela kwa sauti. Daudi jwalombuka kalosi ka Kiduloni pamu na bandu boti bapeta kujenda kulukoba.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Nngolu Abiatali jwapita, hata nu nngolu sadoki jwapita pamu na Alawi boti koni bilitotwi lisanduku li lilaganu laka Sapanga. Bilibekiki pai lisanduku laka Sapanga lela mbaka bandu boha pabapeta kuhuma ku musi uku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ndi bambu nkolongu ampwagila Sadoki, “Likelabua lisanduku lililaganu ku musi. Ana ndenda kujetakeka palongi jaka bambu Sapanga jwiitenda kungelabu nukunhwesesa kulibona kabe lisanduku laki nukupabona pajutama. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Lakini ana Bambu sapanga ngase jumbala nepani, henu nepani mi tayali juhengila lokapi lejubona lasapi kwaki.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Kabee Bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila nngolu Sadoki, “Boo, wehapa unndota waka Sapanga? Mbuja kunyumba sulukwali wehapa pamu na bana baku, Ahimaasi na Yonasani mwana waka Abiasali. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Lakini niibia nendale ku mitandu kulungwenza kongo mbaka pawiimbwagila wehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Ndi Sadoki na Abiatali bilikelabua Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga ku musi uku Yelusalemu, nukuigali hoku.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Lakini Daudi jaendaliya na sapwali jakwela kitombi si Mizeituni koni julela, sanga ilatu ni kimutu saki atei kuyeku. Hata bandu boti bababii pamu najombi bayekaliya imutu yabu babiya atenda kulela. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Kipindi sehesi, Daudi ampwagila kubanga hata Ahitofeli jabii jumu jwa bandu banga kujetakeka palongi jaka Sapanga na babijiungiki na Abusalomu. Lakini Daudi jaloba nukupwaaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga nukuloba, guhenga mpangu wa Ahitofeli wiiwesikana.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi pajahika mu keleli ikitombi, pandu pukunndumbali Sapanga, mundu jumu liina laki Hushai kuhuma Aliki jahika ili kumpengana, ingobu yaki yabiya ijendukini pamutu jakigubii luhombi. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi ampwagila, “Ana gubii pamu nanepani wibiya nsigu. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Lakini ana gukelabwiki ku musi uku Yelusalemu nukumpwagi Absalomu, ‘Niibiya nuntumisi waku mwaa bambu nkolongu, ngati enabii nuntumisi wa atati baku, pu uwanzu,’ ndienu wiihengila mpangu wa Ahitofeli jiiwesa. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Boo agolu Sadoki na Abiatali ngabiikubi pamu na wehapa? Waapwagila sokapi lewijoana mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Linga bana baku boti abeli akanalomi, Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki na Yonasani mwana waka Abiatali abii pamu nabombi. Na sokapi semwiijoa mwiimbelakiya majambu gangu kwi indela jabu.” <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ndienu, Hushai nkosi waka bambu nkolongu Daudi, jakelubuka ku musi kipindi Abusalomu pajajingala ku musi Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Siba na bambu nkolongu Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi pajwabia jukipetiki lubekubeku lu kitombi, Siba ntumisi waka Mefibosheti ampengana Daudi koni jubii na maponda mabeli gababia agatandiki koni gatotwii mabumunda mia mbili ni ishada mia jimu ya zabibu nyomu na matunda mia jimu gikilangasi ni kiliba sa divai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Bambu nkolongu andalukia Siba “Ndaba jakii guletiki hindu hayeye?” Siba jwajibua, “Liponda libi kwa ndaba jukukwela nndongu waku, Mabumunda na matunda gikilangasi ga aka akombu boti na divai jibii kwa ndaba ja babihinduka kulukoba.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Bambu nkolongu andalukia, “Mwana waka bambu waku jubii kwaa?” Siaba ampwagila bambu waki, “Jwombi juigali ku musi uku Yelusalemu ndaba juholale bandu buku Izalaeli bankelabukia ubambu ukolongu gowabii waka Sauli ahoku baki.”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila Siba, “Nala mali gaka Mefibosheti henu gabia mali gaku.” Siba ampwagila, “Nugusengu ngamaa wa bambu nkolongu wangu, nane noba gunhengila gaamboni kila masoba goti.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei andapi mbamba bambu nkolongu Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Daudi pajwahika ku Bahulimu jwapitila mundu jumu julukolu lwaka Sauli liinalaki Shimei mwana waka Gela, jwatumbulia kundapi mbamba mala jingi. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Anndekalia bambu nkolongu Daudi malibu pamu na atumisi baki. Hata ngati makundi goha na alonda boha babia bunhyongalwiti Daudi upandi wa kumangega nu upandi wa kwamalele. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei andapila Daudi mbamba koni jupwaga, “Boka hapa, wehapa wamundu jojukoma, mundu jwanga na mana. <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Bambu Sapanga jugulepisi kisasi ndaba waakomiki alongu baka Sauli jojuwe wehapa sajenu gujukwi kiteu saki su ubambu ukolongu. Henu Bambu Sapanga ampeki ubambu Abusalomu mwana waku. Linga henu kukomeka kuguhiki ndaba wehapa wa mundu jojukoma.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ndienu Abishai mwana waka Seluya ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Ndaba jaki jimbwa aje juguligila mbamba wehapa wabambu wango? Nekakia nunzendila nakasekula kimutu saki.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Lakini bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Bo, kibi kii kati jangu nepani na mwanganya mwabana baka Seluya? Ana Bambu Sapanga jutei kumpwagi, ‘Nndigila mbamba Daudi’, Nya enu juwesa kulaluki, ‘Ndaba jaki gutei hela?’” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Kabe bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila Abishai na atumisi baki boti, “Ana mwana wangu namweti juhepale kungoma boo, ngakwiikubi namangani kwa mundu ju likabila la abenyamine haba awesa kungoma? Munndeka junigila yaambmba ndaba Bambu Sapnga anndagalaki junigila mbamba. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Pangi Bambu Sapanga julingali ubaja wangu najombi juamu kunepa waamboni kukundende yaambamba yembata lelenu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Daudi na bandu baki baendalia na sapwali koni shimei juendale kumpwata koni anndekale malibu nukunnzitali luombi kunani bambu nkolongu Daudi. Shimei jukubika jujenda kunani jikitombi pambipi na bambu nkolongu Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu pamu na bandu boti bababia pamu najombi bahika kulosi koni asokiki. Ndi batenda kupomulela.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu ku musi Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Kipindi sehesi Abusalomu na bandu boti buku Isilaeli bajenda kumusi uku Yelusalemu na Aitofeli pamu na bombi. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Ndi Ushai jojuhumi ku Aliki, nkosi waka Daudi anzendila Abusalomu nukumpwagi, “Bambu nkolongu gutama masoba gingi.”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abusalomu andalukia Ushai, “Bo, konioku ndi kuobaleka kwaku kwaka Daudi? Mbona ngasewapiti pamu nu nkosi wako?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Ushai jwajibua, “Ngaela ndaba mundu jojwiihaguliwa na Bambu Sapanga na jojwiiaguliwa na bandu haba na jojwiihaguliwa na bandu boa buku Izalaeli hoju ndi niibia waki nanepani niigalia pamu najombi. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Baada ja haga nantumakia nyane? Nga le mwana uka nkosi wango? Nala ngati henaatumakia atati baku ndi enagutumakia wehapa.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Ndi Abusalomu ampwagila Aitofeli, “Nyangatia mawasu nhenga kike?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Aitofeli ampwagila Abusalomu, “Ugonila na mabangu ga atati baku gajugaleka kutunza nyumba jaki. Mwenikatai bandu buku Izilaeli pabiijowana atati baku atei kugusuki, hapa ndi bandu boha bababi pamu na wehapa biipata makili.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Ndi bandu bumpegila Abusalumu lihema ku kipagaa najombi jwagonila na masulia ga atati baki, bandu boti buku Izilaeli koni babiya alinga. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Lisoba heli mawasu gokapi gajwapia Aitofeli gabia ngati jupiiki Sapanga. Daudi na abusalomu mawasu haga.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Ushai ankonga Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Pamu na haga, Ahitafeli ampwagila Abusalomu, “Nekakia nhagula bandu elupu komi naabeli alapu nyenda kumpwata Daudi lelenu ikilu. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nanndapula kipindi jusokiki na ngasejubii na makili na nepani nanzonzukia kiholu. Bandu boti baabii pamu najombi biitenda kuntila. Nanndapula bambu nkolongu kajika jaki, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kwakelabu bandu bangi boti kwaku, ngati kamwali wandoa hejujenda kunyumba jaka nndomi waki. Kuwa kwa mundu jumu kwiileta lukwali kwa bandu boti, nga mundu hata jumu jojwiumia.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Mawasu gaka Aitofeli gunndengani Abusalomu na aseja boti buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ndienu Abusalumu jwapwaga, “Munkema na Ushai mundu juku Aliki tujowana sejupala kupwaga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Ushai pajwahika kwaka Abusalumu anndalukia, “Hela ndi hejupwagiki Aitofeli. Bo, tuenga ngati ejutupwagi? Ana ngahela nala tupwagila tuhenga kike.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai ampwagila Abusalomu, “Mawasu gajupiiki Aitofeli nga gaambone.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Hushai jaendalia kupwaga, “Wehapa gumanya atati baku na bandu baki ndi abii na makili na ayomiki ngati kinyama sa dubu kimbomba sekibii ku lukoba jobunnyagiki bana baki. Kabe gumanya atati baku ayobali ngondu. Bombi nga biitami kelukelu pamu na bandu baki. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata sajenu tayali julihiiki ku mabomba gagabii kola au pandu pangi. Mundu jokapi jojwiijowa kukomeka kwa bandu mu ngondu jakwanza jwiipwaga kubanga kupitii kuhuma ku likundi la bandu babumpwata Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Bandu baku pabiijowa hela, hata bandu baku baabi na makili, baabi na mioju ngati giliimba, biibagaja kulujogopu. Ndaba Aizilaeli boti amanya kubanga atati baku abii na moju wanga kujogopa na boti baabii pamu na jombi abii nganganganga. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Se nhwesa kupwaga nepani ndi senze, waakusanya bandu boti buku Izilaeli kutumbuli ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli sheba upandi uku kusini abia bingi ngati nsangi guku mbwani na wamweti gujenda ku ngondu. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Natwepani twanzendila Daudi pandu pokapi pajwiiwesa kupatikana na twanhabukia ngati ulumi eguabuki pai. Henu nga mundu jojwiigalia hata ngati jwiibia mweni au bandu baki boti baabi pamu na jombi. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Ana jwiitilila musi gongi, nala bandu boha buku Izilaeli biileta migoji nukuuta musi hogu mbaka kumosu nga kiigali sindu sokapi hata lilibu lisokopi la musi hogu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abusalomu pamu na bandu boha buku Izilaeli bapwaga, “Malobi gajupwagiki Ushai ndi gasapi kupeta malobi gajupwagiki Aitofeli.” Ndi bakana malobi gaka Aitofeli ndaba bambu Sapanga jwabia jupangiki kugapenga malobi gajupwagiki Aitofeli ili juwesa kunndeta Abusalomu ling'ai.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ushai ampwagi Daudi jutila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Ndienu Ushai jwaapwagila agolu baka Sapanga, Sadoki na Abiatali namuna Aitofeli na mweni hebumpwagila sukuhenga Abusolumu na Aseja buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Jwaapwagila bukumpwagila nyata Daudi ikilu jwiigone ku mitandu jukulombuke kulukoba ila julobuka kwa namuna jokapi julobuka ili bankamu nu kunkoma jombi pamu na bandu baki boha. <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Kipindi sehesi Yonasani na Ahimaasi babia atenda kunndendale pambipi na kiliba sa Enilogeli ili jwaabona mundu jokapi pabiijingala ku musi. Kila kipindi ntumisi jumu mmbomba jujenda kwaapwagi malobi nabombi ajendika kumpwagi bambu nkolongu Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Lakini kipindi senze babonikana nu nkombu jumu jojuwe jwapiti kumpwagi Abusalomu. Ndienu Yonasani na Ahimaasi baboka nyatanyata bajenda ku Bahulimu kunyumba jaka mundu jumu jojwabii ni kiliba kuua jaki. Bajingala mukiliba sela nukuliia. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mmbomba jwana nyumba jola jwajukua kipuniku nukukiyekale kiliba sela, ndienu jajanika ilebi panani jikipuniku sela. Lijambu lela ngase lamanyikine. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Atumisi baka Abusalomu pabaika kukummbomba jola, bunndalukia, “Ahimasi na Yonasani abikwako?” Mmbomba jola jwaapwagila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">“Apiti kwii ja losi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Pabaataputa na kwaakosa babuja ku musi uku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Egapeta haga atumisi baka Abusalomu batenda kuboka, Yonasani na Aimaasi babita mukiliba nukujenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Daudi nukumpwagi lijambu heli. Bumpwagila “Boka gujenda kwii ja losi, ndaba Aitofeli ampwagila Abusalomu majambu gu kugulongale wehapa.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Ndi Daudi jwaboka na bandu boa bababia pamu najombi, balombuka losi Yoludani. Pakwakusa nga mundu jokapi jojwaigali kuunyuma bila kulomboka losi lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahitofeli jutenda kulikongela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli pajwabona bandu ngaseahengiki ngati he jwapwaga, jwakwela liponda laki nukujenda kunyumba ku musi waki. Pajwaika kola jwapangiki sapi majambu gukunyumba jaki nukulikongela. Jwakuwa nukuntaga mu litenge la atati baki.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Ndienu Daudi jwajenda ku Mahanaimu. Abusalomu jwalombuka losi Yoludani na bandu boa buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Kipindi hesi Abusalomu jwabia ammbei Amasa kuba nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu badala jaka Yoabu. Amasa jwabia mwana waka Yeteli, ju ukoo wa Ishimaeli. Anyongo baki bunkemika Abigaili kamwali waka Nahashi jojwabia ndombu waka Seluya, anyongo baka Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abusalomu pamu na bandu buku Izilaeli babeka kambi jabu ku nndema uku Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi pajwaika ku Mahanaimu, Shobi mwana waka Naashi Nhamoni kuhuma kumusi uku Laba, Makili mwana waka Amilieli kuhuma ku musi uku Lodebali pamu na Balizilai mundu ju nkoa uku Geliadi kuuma ku musi uku Logelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />bapelika itanda na mabilika na yombu yu lutopi na nganu na shaili nu uwembi ni ilombi ikalangi na ngondi na ndambai, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />busi na masiba gaga gandiki na makondo na mahuta ga masiba kuhuma mu mipugu jabu kumpeke Daudi pamu na bandu bajwabii nabu. Ndaba bapwaga, “Bandu haba abii ni inzala, asokiki na abii na nywita ndaba jukujenda kulukoba.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu jutenda kusindwa nu kunkoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi jwaakusanya bandu bajwabia pamu nabu na kwaabagana mu makundi ga bandu maelupu pai na makundi ga bandu mamia na bombi babia pai ja aka kilongosi ba akomana ngondu babu. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi jwaatuma akomana ngondu baki kungondu mu makundi gatatu, likundi limu lilongoswa na Yoabu ni likundi lapili lilongoswa na Abishai mwana waka Seluya, nndongu waka Yoabu ni likundi la tatu jalongua Itai mundu juku Giti. Ndienu bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaapwagila boa, “Namweti niijenda pamu na mwanganya.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Lakini bandu bumpwagila, “Ngaguboke. Ndaba ana twiitenda kutila nga batuwasalile. Kabee ana nusu jitu biitenda kuwa ngabatuangajakile. Lakini wehapa gupalika ngani kupeta bandu elupu komi kati jitu. Henu mbanga wehapa guigalia ku musi nukutujangati twepani koni gubii kumusi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Bambu nkolongu jwaapwagila, “Niihenga lokapi lemmbona laamboni.” Ndienu bambu nkolongu jwajema pambipi ni litanga koni akomana ngondu baki, mamia na maelupu atenda kupeta. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Bambu nkolongu anndagalakia Yoabu na Abishai na Itai, “Munhengila nkombu jola majambu gaamboni kwa ndaba jangu nepani.” Bandu boha bunzowana bambu nkolongu pajwaalagalakia akomana ngondu baki.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ndienu akomana ngondu baka Daudi bajenda kulukoba kukomana na bandu buku Izilaeli. Ngondu heji jahengika mu kiholi suku Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Atumisi baka Daudi baawesa bandu buku Izilaeli. Lisoba heli bandu ngati elupu ishilini batenda kuwa. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Kukomana hoku kwaeni mu nndema woti na bandu bingi bakuwa kukiholi kupeta babawi ku upanga mu ngondu.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Ndienu Abusalomu koni jukwei kinyama sebikikema nyumbu, jwaketangana na atumisi baka Daudi. Nyumbu jela pajabia jitenda kupeta pai jilimbandi likolongu lunhaloni, pala ndi kimutu saka Abusalomu sapatila mu nkongu mwaloni. Abusalomu bunndeka koni jujenzee panani. Lakini nyumbu jaki jabia jiendale kulongi. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mundu jongi jojwabona lijambu lela ampwagila Yoabu, “Numbweni Abusalomu jujenze mu nkongu gu mwaloni.” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu ampwagila mundu jola, “Kii? Umbweni Abusalomu? Ndaba jaki ngasegukomike apalapala? Nakatoguli nu kugulepa ipandi selasini ya madini ga feza nu nkanda uku nkomana ngondu jwana makili.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Lakini mundu jola ampwagila Yoabu, “Hata nakajopiki ipandi elupu jimu ya madini ga feza mu kuboku jangu, nga nakatondabii kuboku kwangu kwaka mwana waka bambu nkolongu. Ndaba tunzowini bambu nkolongu pajutulagalakia wehapa wa Abishai na Atai twepani koni tujoa, munndonda Abusalomu kwa ndaba jangu. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Na nepani ana nakabia ngasenunzowani bambu nkolongu nu kunkoma Abusalomu, bambu nkolongu jwakabia jujowani, jwombi jujowane kila sindu na ngawakawesiki kung'engalela.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu ampwagila, “Nepani ngasemii ni kipindi sukuhoa pamba pamu na wehapa.” Ndienu Yoabu jwajukua mikoa misoku mitatu mukuboku kwaki. Nukujenda kunhosa Abusalomu pamoju jaki, Abusalomu koni jubi jwakona mwomi pilimbandi la mwaloni.<verse eid="2SA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ndienu aka kombu komi bababia buntotuli nhindu yukukomane Yoabu, bahika kuyongolota Abusalomu, bunndapula nu kunkoma. <verse eid="2SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Ndipala Yoabu jwapega imbata na akomana ngondu boa bakotuka kwaapwata bandu buku Izilaeli, ndaba Yoabu jwatenda kwaakanaki. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Bunzukua Abusalomu nukunndeke mu libomba likolongu nu kulundika lilundu likolongu la malibu. Bandu boti buku Izilaeli batenda kutila kila jumu kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Abusalomu pajwabia mwomi jwabia jujukwi mipendi nukuijemeka mu ligomba laka bambu nkolongu ndaba jwapwaga, “Nepani ngase mii na mwana mwanalomi jojwiiendalisa ngombuke yi liina lango.” Mipendi jela jujipekia liina laki, na biikema, Mipendi yaka Abusalomu mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi bumpwagi kupete kuwa kwaka Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Ndienu Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki jwapwaga, “Nekakia nukumpwagila bambu nkolongu kubanga Bambu Sapanga ankombwi kuhuma mu makili ga abaja baki.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu ampwagila, “Lelenu ngagujendi kupwaga majambu haga. Wiijenda kupwaga lisoba lenge. Lakini lelenu ngagujendi kulonge sokapi ndaba mwana waka bambu nkolongu jutei kuwa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ndi Yoabu ampwagila mundu jumu juku Kushi, “Jenda ukumpwagila bambu nkolongu gaugabweni.” Nkushi jola jwajinama ku isima palongi jaka Yoabu nu kujenda imbelu.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ndienu Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki ampwagila kabee Yoabu, “Nga gupitii ubaja, nekakia nepani nunzombatakia nkushi jola.” Yoabu ampwagila, “Mbona gupala kutila mwana wango? Wehapa nga gupati nhupi jokape kupete lijambu lendeno.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi jwapwaga, “Hata kipiti sokapi niitenda kutila.” Ndienu Ahimaasi jwatila nu kujenda indela juku lungwenza mbaka ampea Nkushi jola.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Daudi jwabia jutemi pikilanda ji matanga mabeli pa musi. Najwombi nndonda jwilitanga jwakwela pulumatu mbaka panani ji litanga na pajwajumuka ammbona mundu jwakatila kajika jaki. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Ndonda jola jwapia sauti nukumpwagi bambu nkolongu, “Ana jubii kajika jaki kupalika jumanyiki.” Mundu jola jwaendalia kuhegale.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Ndonda jola ammbona mundu jongi jutenda kutila, jwakema kabe pilitanga, “Linga mundu jongi jutenda kutila kajika jaki.” Bambu nkolongu jwapwaga, “Najombi juhika kutupwagi majambu ga sapi gagapiiti.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Nndonda jola jwapwaga, “Ne mona jojutila ngani jola ndi Ahimaasi mwana waka Sadoki.” Bambu nkolongu jwapwaga, “Hoju mundu jwaamboni jutulete majambu gaamboni.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ndi Ahimaasi ampwagila bambu nkolongu kwa sauti ngolongu, “Majambu goti gabii sapi.” Jwajinama nukupega magoti palongi jaka bambu nkolongu nukupwaga, “Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jojugukombwi kuhuma kwa bandu babapala kugukoma nu kuguhenge majambu mabaja, waa bambu nkolongu wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Boo, nkombu Abusalomu jujumwike?” Ahimaasi jwajibwa, “Yoabu pajwanduma nepani ntumisi waku, nabona kwabia na keleli ingipi lakini ngase namanyiki sauti yela ilangi kiki.” <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Bambu nkolongu jwapwaga, “Tama pulutengu na wiijema hapa.” Ndienu Ahimaasi jajenda pulutengu nukujema nuu.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ndipala Nkushi jola jwatenda kuhika, najombi jwapwaga, “Nuguletiki lijambu laamboni wa bambu nkolongu wangu. Ndaba bambu Sapanga lelenu jugukombwi kuhuma kwa bandu boti bababia apala kuguhenge majambu giliya.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Bambu nkolongu, anndalukia, “Boo, nkombu Abusalomu jujumwike?” Nkushi jola jwajibua, “Abaja baku bambu nkolongu pamu na bandu boti baapala gugupata majambu mabaja, abia ngati nkombu Abusalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu jwabia na uzuni ngolongu, jwakwela ku sumba sesabii panani ja sumba sesabii panani ju nndyangu nu kulela. Pajwabia jutenda kukwela jwabia julela koni jupwaga, “Wamwana wangu Abusalomu, Ana nakabia nhwii badala jaku! Wakabia upatiki majambu gilia, Abusalomu! Abusalomu mwana wango!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu anndakali bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu bumpwagila kubanga bambu nkolongu jwabia julela nu kulobalake ndaba jakua kwaka mwana waki Abusolomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ndienu, kuwesa kwabu ku lisoba lela kwang'anambuka kuba kulelaneka kwa bandu boha, pabajowana kubanga bambu nkolongu andele mwana waki Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Henu lisoba lela bandu bajingala ku musi kinunu ngati bandu baabuja kumusi koni abona iyoni sukutila ngondu. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Bambu nkolongu juliyekalia pamiu jaki nukulela kwa sauti ngolongu koni jupwaga, “Nandi mwanawangu Abusalomu! Nandi mwana wangu! Mwanawango!” <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ndi Yoabu jwajingala kunyumba jaka bambu nkolongu, nukumpwagi, “Lelenu gutupoiki lihamu twepani twaatumisi baku twaboha twetuhokwii womi waku lelenu, na womi wa bana baku akanalomi na womi wa bana baku akambomba na womi wa aka ahanu baku na womi wa mabangu gaku. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Wehapa waapala bala babugusuki na waasuki babugupala. Gutulangii hotuhotu kupwaga aka kilongosi baakomana ngondu baku na atumisi baku ngaseabii na mana kwaku. Mona ana lelenu Abusalomu jakabi mwomi, twepani twaboha twakabia tukuiki, ndi wehapa wakabia gutoguli. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Henu gujema gulongila na atumisi baku si isima. Ndaba napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga kubanga ana ngagujendi kulonge nabu ngahata jumu jojwiihigalia pamu na wehapa lelenu pakamii. Lendenu liibia lijambu lilia ngani kwaku wehapa kupeta majambu gilia goti gagupatiki toka pawabia unkombu mbaka lelenu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu jwapita nukujenda nukutama pandu paki pambipi ni litanga. Bandu boha pabamanya bambu nkolongu jubii pi litanga batenda kunnzende.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi julianda kubuja ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Kipindi sehesi bandu boha buku Izilaeli babia atiliki kila jumu kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Bandu boha babia abisana beni na beni mu makabila goha guku Izilaeli, koni apwaga, “Bambu nkolongu Daudi jutukombula mu maboku ga abaja bitu, jutukombula mu maboku gaka Afilisiti. Lakini henu jugutiliki nndema waki ndaba jaka Abusalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />“Kabee Abusalomu jojuwe tunzakania mahuta ili jubia bambu nkolongu witu, henu jukuiki ku ngondu. Henu ndaba jakii ngase tulongale kunkelabu bambu nkolongu Daudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaatuma bandu ajenda kwa agolu akolongu Sadoki na Abiatali, “Waapwagila, aseja buku Yuda, ‘Ndaba jakii bombi abia ndi bamwisu kunkelabu bambu nkolongu kunyumba jake? Malobi ga Aizilaeli boti ganhiki nepani bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mwanganya mwaalongu bango, mwanganya mwabandu ba mwai wango, ndaba jakii mbia mwabandu ba mwisu kungelabu nepani bambu nkolongu kunyumba? <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Munndalukia kabee Amasa ana jwombi nga mundu wa mwai gwango. Kabee Sapanga jungoma ana toka lelenu nga nunhengi jombi kuba kilongosi wa akomana ngondu bangu badala jaka Yoabu.’” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Daudi jaatogulisa miaoju bandu boti buku Yuda nabombi ni liwasu limu. Ndienu, baatuma bandu kumpwagi, “Gukelabuka kunyumba wehapa na aka atumisi baku boha.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ndi bambu nkolongu jwahika ku losi luku Yoludani na bandu boha buku Yuda bahika mbaka ku Giligali kumpengana bambu nkolongu nu kunndoboo palosi ja Yoludani.<verse eid="2SA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anndekake mahakau Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimei mwana waka Gela, Mbenyamini jukuhumi ku Baulimu jwahenga nyata kujenda pamu na bandu bangi ili kumpengana bambu nkolongu Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei jwapiti pamu na Abenyamini elupu jimu. Siba ntumisi wa alongu baka Sauli pamu na bana baki komi nu nhwanu atumisi ishilini bajenda nyata ku losi Yoludani kunndongule bambu nkolongu Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Ndi balombuka mu ntandu ili kwahindaki alongu baka bambu nkolongu nu kunhenge bambu nkolongu goha gajugapala. Shimei mwana waka Gela jwatenda kuhika, japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai palongi jaka bambu nkolongu, kipindi bambu nkolongu pajwabia juhegale kuloboka losi luku Yoludani. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Nuguloba wa bambu nkolongu wangu wiimalangi kuba ni likosa wala kukomboka likosa lenahengiki lisobalela pawabia guboka pamusi uku Yelusalemu. Nuguloba gwiiholale liyaa wala wagaholale ngani. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Ndaba nepani ntumisi waku manya kubanga nahengiki mahakau. Hela ndi ndaba jukuhika lelenu, nepani ndi netumbuli kuhuma mu likabila laka Josepu kuhika kugupengana wehapa wabambu nkolongu wangu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Ndi Abishai mwana waka Seluya jwapwaga, “Boo, Shimei ngasejupalika kukomeka ndaba anndigila yaambamba mundu jojuwe Bambu Sapanga anhagula sukumpaki mahuta?” <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Lakini Daudi jwapwaga, “Mwabana baka Seluya, ngasemi nu ubaja na mwanganya, henu ndaba jaki mlihenga ngati mwaabaja bangu leleno? Boo, jukomika mundu jokapi pa Izilaeli pani leleno? Nepani ndi bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli na nga mundu jokapi kati ja Aizilaeli jo ngiti jukomika lelenu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ndi bambu ampwagila Shimei, “Wehapa nga gukuwe.” Bambu nkolongu anndapila Shimei.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anndekake Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti nsokoo waka Sauli jwajenda najwombi kumpengana bambu nkolongu Daudi. Toka lisobalela bambu nkolongu hejwaboka ku Yelusalemu mbaka hejwakelabuka sapi, Mefibosheti jwabia ngase jusambisi masi magolu gaki nu kumoga indeu yaki na ngasejwapiki ingobu yaki. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ndi pajwahika ku Yelusalemu kumpengana bambu nkolongu Daudi, bambu nkolongu Daudi anndalukia, “Boo, Mefibosheti ndaba jakii ngasewapiti pamu na nepane?” <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti jwapwaga, “Mwaa bambu nkolongu wangu, ntumisi wangu jwatenda kungonga. Ndaba nepani ntumisi waku numpwagila, ‘Nhandaliya liponda ngwela ili nyenda pamu na bambu nkolongu.’ Ndaba nepani ntumisi waku mi ni kilema <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Henu jutei kungopake kwaku wabambu nkolongu wangu. Lakini wabambu nkolongu wangu gubii ngati ntumisi jukunani waka Sapanga. Guhenga lokapi legulibona laamboni kwaku. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Ndaba alongu bangu boha baahumi kwaatati bangu babia bandu baapalika kukomeka palongi jaku wabambu nkolongu wangu. Lakini wameka nepani kuba kati ja bandu baakula pamesa jaku. Ngasembalika kuloba sindu sokapi kwaku wa bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Wiimbwagi nakanopi majambu gaku wamwete. Nepani tayali hamwi kubanga wehapa pamu na Siba mwiibagana milema jaka Sauli.” <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Lakini Mefibosheti ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Nndeka Siba jujukua nndema joka kajika jake. Nepani ndosiki kwa ndaba wehapa wa bambu nkolongu wangu kubuja kunyumba sapi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anhenge waamboni Balizilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Balizilai Mgileadi jwabia juhikiki kuhuma ku Logelimu. Jwabia jupiti pamu na bambu nkolongu ku losi luku Yoludani ili kunhindaki mbaka ku kwii ja losi. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Balizilai jwabia nseja ngamaa, jojubii na yaka semanini. Najombi Balizilai jukubika ampelake posu bambu nkolongu pajwabi ku Mahanahimu, ndaba jwabia mundu jojubii na mali gingipi. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Daudi ampwagila Balizilai, “Tuboka twaboha ku Yelusalemu nepani niitenda nagupekiya hindu yegupala.” <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Lakini Balizilai ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Boo, mii na yaka ingi yukutama punndema pani mbaka nyenda pamu na wehapa ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Nepani lelenu mi na yaka semanini. Boo, mii lee nu uwesu ukumanya majambu boo, gasapi na majambu boo mabaja? Boo, nepani ntumisi waku nhwesa kumanya kunong'ame au kubaba kwa sindu sengula au kunywa? Boo, niiwesa kumanya sauti ja bandu baajemba akanalomi au akambomba? Ndaba ja kii nepani ntumisi waku mia nsigu gongi kwaku wehapa, bambu nkolongu wango? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Nepani ntumisi waku niijenda mbaka pambipi pee kwii ja Yoludani. Ndaba jakii bambu nkolongu junepa nhupi ngolongu ana? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nuguloba gunekakia ntumisi waku nguila mu musi wangu pambipi nilitenge la atati bango na amabango. Lakini ntumisi waku Kimhamu, gunndeka jujenda pamu na wehapa bambu nkolongu wangu na gunhengila jwombi lokapi legubona libii laamboni.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Kimhamu jwiijenda pamu na nepani na miti nunhengila lokapi lelibii laamboni kwaku. Na lokapi lewiipala nuguhengila niitenda kuguhenge.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ndi bandu boha balombuka losi luku Yoludani na bambu nkolongu najwombi jwatenda kuloboka. Bambu nkolongu ambuswa nukumpenge Balizilai na Balizilai jwabuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu buku Yuda na buku Izilaeli apengana ndaba jaka bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Bambu nkolongu jwaendalia mbaka ku Gileadi, najombi Kimhamu jwabia julongini naku. Bandu boha buku Yuda na bandu buku Izilaeli babia anhindaki bambu nkolongu.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Ndienu bandu boti buku Izilaeli bahika kwaka bambu nkolongu nukumpwagi, “Ndaba jaki alongu bitu bandu buku Yuda alibona bombi ndi baapalika kugujukua wehapa nukugulombo ku losi luku Yoludani, wehapa nu nndongu waku pamu na bandu bako?” <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Bandu buku Yuda baapwagila bandu buku Izilaeli, “Ndaba bambu nkolongu hoju ndi nndongu witu jwapambipi. Ndaba jaki nnyoma kupete lijambu hele? Boo, tukuliki sokapi kipindi soti kukulepa bambu nkolongo? Au jombi jutupeki nhupi jokape?” <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Bandu buku Izilaeli baajibwa bandu buku Yuda, “Tubii na haki mala komi kupete bambu nkolongu, kupeta haki yemmbinaku mwanganya na hata kupetee Daudi mwene. Ndaba jakii mutupoa lihamo? Boo, twepani lee ngasetwabia twabandu bukutumbuli kupwaga bambu nkolongu witu jubujaje?” Malobi ga bandu buku Yuda gabiya makolongu kupeta malobi ga bandu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba ang'anambuka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Ndienu kwabia ku Giligali kwabia na mundu mmbaja jobunkema Sheba mwana waka Bikili mbenyamini. Ndienu Sheba jwajemba imbata nukujamali kwa sauti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">“Ngasetubii na sindu kwaka Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">ngasetubi na sukupata kwaka mwana waka Yese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">Mwabandu buku Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">kila mundu jujenda kunyumba jake!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ndi bandu boti buku Izilaeli bunndeka Daudi nukumpwata Sheba mwana waka Bikili. Lakini bandu buku Yuda bumpwata bambu nkolongu Daudi kukuhobaleka kutumbuli ku losi Yoludani mbaka kumusi uku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Mwisu we Daudi jwahika kunyumba jaki ku musi uku Yelusalemu. Najombi jwagajukua mabangu gaki komi gajabia jagalekiki gatama kulingali nyumba jaki jwagabekiki mu nyumba jimu pai juulonda, jwagatunza sapi, lakini ngasejwagoni naku. Ndienu mabangu gala jabia jagabekiki nkati mbaka masoba ga kuwa kwabu, batemi ngati akambomba baawii alomi babu.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu ampwagila Amasa, “Gungemila bandu boti buku Yuda mu masoba matatu, na wamweti wiibia.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ndienu Amasa jwajenda kwaakema bandu buku Yuda. Lakini jaseliwi kubuja kipindi sesela sejwapangiwa na bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi ampwagila Abishai, “Henu Sheba mwana waka Bikili jwatuletila majambu gilia kupeta gajwaleta Abusalomu. Jukua atumisi bangu unkagula Sheba jwiijingi mu misi jejibii na nyumba ja akomana ngondu nukutila nga tummboni kabete.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai jwatenda kuboka koni jubii na Yoabu na Akeleti na Apeleti pamu na bandu banga kujogopa boti. Boti haba baboka ku Yelusalemu kujenda kunkagu Sheba mwana waka Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Pabaika kulilibu likolongu lelibi ku Gibeoni, Amasa jwapita kwaapengana. Yoabu jwabia juweti ingobu ya akomana ngondu nu nkati jiingobu hei kwabia nunkanda gogwabia gukamulaki upanga mukibunu jaki koni gubii munhaku waki. Yoabu pajwabia jutenda kuhegale upanga waki watenda kuhopoka nu kuhabuka pai. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu ampwagila Amasa, “Boo, nndonguwango gujumwiki lena?” Yoabu ankamula Amasa mukileu saki kukuboku kwamalele ngati jupala kumbusu. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Lakini Amasa ngasejugubweni upanga gowabia mu kuboku kwaka Yoabu. Ndienu Yoabu anhosa Amasa upanga mulitumbu, matumbu gaki gapita kunza na kuwa. Yoabu ngaseanhosiki upanga mala pabele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Ndienu Yoabu nu nndongumundu Abishi baendalia kumpwatali Sheba mwana waka Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Mundu jumu kati ja bandu baka Yoabu jwaika nukujema pambipi na nhyega jaka Amasa nukupwaga, “Mundu jokapi joampala Yoabu na jokapi joampala Daudi, ampwata Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa jwabia jwakona jugalauka pa mwai waki pikilanda ji indela ngolongu. Henu kila mundu jojwapeta pala eambona jwatenda kujema. Lakini mundu jola pajwabona bandu boha ahikiki nukujema pala jujiboa nhyega jaka Amasa piindela nukujipeleka kulitui nukujiyekale niingobu. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa pabumboa mu indela ngolongu, henu bandu boha baendalia kumpwata Yoabu ili kumpwatali Sheba mwana waka Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba jwapetila mu makabila goa guku Izilaeli mbaka ku musi uku Abeli gogubii ku Beti maaka. Bandu boa bulukolu luku Bikili bakusanyika nu kumpwata. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Bandu boa bababia pamu na Yoabu bajenda kuyongolota Sheba pajwabia ku musi uku Abeli gogubii ku Beti maaka. Balundikana kuguyongolota musi hogu gogubii na ngomi, ndienu batumbulia kubombo lumatu lwaki ili kuguabu pai. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Ndienu mmbomba jongi jojubii na malangu jwajowanika kuhuma ku musi koni jupwaga, “Nzowanya! Nzowania! Mumpwagila yoabu juika nongila nako.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu jwajenda pambipi nu mmbomba jola nukumpwagi, “Boo, wehapa le wa Yoabo?” Yoabu jwapwaga, “Ena anenganenga.” Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Nyowania nepani ntumisi waku.” Yoabu jwapwaga, “Nyowanela.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Pamwandi pala bandu babia apwaga, ‘Mwaaleka akajopa mawasu kuhuma ku musi waka Abeli.’ Hela ndi bandu hebabia atemu pasengu. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Nepani ndi jumu kati ja bandu baapala lukwali nu kuhobaleka pa Izilaeli pani. Henu wehapa gupala kuguhalabana musi goguwe gubi ngati amabu pa Izilaeli pani. Ndaba jakii enu gupala kugulapu mbaka kuwa musi goguwe mali gaka bambu Sapanga?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu anzibua, “Ngasembai kualabana wala kugukoma musi hogu hata kulenga na bwaka. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Hegulongi nga sakaka, lakini mundu jumu kuhuma ku milema jaka Efulaimu jobunkema Sheba mwana waka Bikili jupala kunng'anambuka Daudi. Mbekia mundu hoju na nepani niiboka mu nndema winu.” Mmbomba jola ampwagila Yoabu, “Kimutu saki bakilekala kwaku kupete puukuta.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ndienu mmbomba jola jwajenda kwa bandu boa ku musi kukupanga mweni. Bunsekula kimutu Sheba mwana waka Bikili, nukukileke kunza kwaka Yoabu. Ndi Yoabu jwajemba imbata na kwabenga bandu kuboka mu musi guku abeli hogu, kila mundu jwajenda kunyumba jaki. Ndi Yoabu jwabuja kwaka bambu nkolongu Daudi ku musi uku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bunzangatia Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Henu Yoabu jwabia nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu boha buku Izilaeli. Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, jwabia kilongosi jwa Akilete na Apeleti. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu jwabia jojujemale lihengu lukuhenga bilakulepwa, Yeoshafati jwabia jojuhandika ngombuke. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shausha jwabia jojuandika ngombukela, Sadoki na Abiatali babia aka agolu. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Najombi Ila, mundu wa musi uku Yaili jwabia nngolu waka Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Ibeleku yaka Sauli atenda kwaakoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Kipindi simu kwapitila inzala ngolongu punndema, kipindi Daudi pajwabia bambu nkolongu. Inzala heji jatemi yaka itatu. Daudi anndoba bambu Sapanga liwasu. Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Sauli na alongu baki abi na makosa gakwaakoma Agibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ndi bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaakema Agibeoni nu kulonge na bombi. Agibeoni ngasebaapai Aizilaeli ila babia Ahamoli baaigali. Hata ngati bandu buku Izilaeli babia alapiki kwaaleka bomi lakini Sauli jwalengiki kwaakoma boti ndaba jwabia jwaapendale bandu buku Izilaeli na buku Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi jwaalalukia Agibeoni, “Nunhengila kike? Nepa kike ku ubaja go bunntendi ili nhwesa kugupenge nndema gongo na bandu baka Bambu Sapanga?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Agibeoni bunzibua, “Ngasetupalika kulaja madini ga feza wala madini ga zahabu kuhuma kwaka Sauli au alongu baki, wala ngasetupala kunkoma mundu jokapi mu nndema uku Izalaeli.” Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwaalalukia kabe, “Enu mpala nunhengila kike?” <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Bombi bumpwagila bambu nkolongu, “Sauli jwapala kutukoma twepani nu kutuhoa bila kunndeka mundu witu pandu pokapi mu nndema uku Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Nala gutupekia bandu saba kati ja bana baki akanalomi na twepani twaanyonga palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ku kitombi suku Gibea, kwaka Sauli jojwaguliwi na Bambu Sapanga.” Bambu nkolongu jwapwaga, “Nitenda kumpeke.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Lakini bambu nkolongu anndeka Mefibosheti mwana waka Yonasani ndaba Daudi na Yonasani mwana waka Sauli batei kuligani kulihina laka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Lakini Bambu nkolongu anzukua Alumoni na Mefibosheti, bana abeli baka Lisipa kamwali waka Aiya, babube jabiya ambelaki Sauli pamu na bana nhwanu baka Melabu kwamwali waka Sauli, abiya ambelaki Adilieli mwana waka Balizilai, mundu juku Meholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Bana saba akanalomi Daudi jawakabisa kwaka Agibeoni nabombi baabambambalia kukitombi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, boti saba bakuwa pamu. Bana haba baakoma kipindi pababia atumbuli kuhuna inganu.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Ndi Lisipa kamwali waka Aya jwajukua ingobu yiliguni nukulitandiki pililibu. Jwatama pala toka pabatumbulia kuhuna mbaka kipindi siiyula pasaika nukujikuni mitui jela. Kipindi sesela soti jwabia jwiibenga ijuni yukunani niinyama yumukiyoli mui ni ikilu ili ihiki pimitui jela. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi pajwajowa gajutei Lisipa kamwali waka Aya, libangu laka Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />jwajenda nukujuku maupa gaka Sauli na Yonasani mwanawaki kuuma kwa bandu ba Yabeshi gileadi, gababia atei kugajiba kuhuma ku Betishani, kokuje Afilisiti babia ammbambali Sauli na Yonasani lisoba Afilisiti pa bunkoma Sauli ku kitombi suku Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Ndienu Daudi jugakelabua maupa gaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki kuhuma kola, ndi bakusanya maupa gaka akombu saba babaabambali. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ndi bandu baka Daudi bagataga maupa gaka Sauli na Yonasani mwana waki mu nndema waka Benyamini, ku Sela mu litenge laka Kishi atati baka Sauli. Bahenga kila sindu sejwalagalaki Sauli. Egapeta haga ndi Bambu Sapanga jukujowana kuloba kwa bandu ba ndema jela.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli akomana ngondu na Afilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1Majambu gi Ipindi 20:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Ndienu Afilisiti bakomana kabe na Aizilaeli. Daudi na bandu baki bajenda kukomana na Afilisiti. Daudi jwasokiki ngamaa lisoba heli. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishibi Benobu, jumu jwikibeleku si mimundu jojuwe nkoa waki wa shaba gwabia nukutopa kwa kalibu kilu itatu na nusu na jojwabia julikongiki upanga nnyai jwapwaga jankoma Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Lakini Abishai mwana waka Seluya, jwajenda kunzangati Daudi. Abishai anndapula Mfilisiti jola nukunkoma. Ndi bandu bunndapila Daudi koni bakapwaga, “Nga gujendi kabe natwepani kungondo ana ngahela wiisusua taa ju ubambu ukolongu mu nndema uku Izilaeli.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Egapeta haga kwapitila kabe ngondu na Afilisiti ku Gobu. Kipindi hesi Sibekai, mundu juku Mhushati, ankoma Safu jojwabia jumu jwikibeleku saka Alefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Kwapitila kabe ngondu na Afilisiti ku Gobu. Najombi Eluhanani mwana waka Yaaleo legimu, mundu juku Betelehemu ankoma Goliati juku Giti jojuwe mpini gu nkoa waki wabia ngati lupendi wa jojuloka ingobu. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Kwapitila kabe ngondu ku Gati kokukwe kwabia na mundu jumu jwabia nkolongu kuulasu na jojubii na ngonzi sita kila kuboku na ngonzi sita kila kugolu, jumula ngonzi ishilini nu nsesi. Najwombi kabe jwabia kibeleku si mimundu. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Pajwaalongama Aizilaeli, Yonasani mwana waka Shimei, nndongu waka Daudi, jwatenda kunkoma. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Nsesi haba babia kibeleku sa Alefai bandu buku Gati, na Daudi pamu na atumisi baki, batenda kwaakoma.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Nhwambu ukulumbali waka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi anzembila Bambu Sapanga malobi gu nhwambu gongo lisoba lela Bambu sapanga paankombula mumaboku ga abaja baki nu mumaboku gaka Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Jwapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">“Bambu Sapanga ndi lilibu lango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ngome jangu nu nkombosi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Sapanga wangu, ndi lilibu langu, kwaki jwombi ndi kondili womi wango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ngau jangu na makili ga wokopu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ngomi jangu na kwaki jombi ndenda kutili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Nhokosi wangu, gunhoko kuhuma kwa bandu abaja.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Nunkema bambu Sapanga jojupalika ulumbi jojunyangati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">nanepani junhoko kuhuma kwa abaja bangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Ndaba kuwa kwatenda kunhyongalota ngati majeba ga masi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">masi gingi gukukoma gatenda kunhiki,<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Migoji jukulibomba lilasu jandenda kuyongalota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">Mitaba ja kuwa jatenda kunhiki.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mu mang'aliku gangu nunkema Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nunkema Sapanga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kuhuma mu nyumba jaki jwajowana Sauti jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">kilelusangu satenda kunhiki mu makutu jaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Pala ndi nndema watenda kubagaja nukunyukanyuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">misingi yukunani kwaka Sapanga yatenda kujonga jonga nukuhomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">ndaba Sapanga jwabia jutei kuyoma.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Lihoi lapita kuhuma mu imbulu jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">mwotu gogutinyi wapita munndomu waki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">makalakala ga mwotu galipuka kuhuma munndomu waki.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Jukuyekula kunani nukukuhulu pai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">ni liundi lijilu pai ja magolu gaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Jwakwei kiumbi sekibii na mapapati nu kugoloka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">jwabonikana panani ja mapapati gu nhwai.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Juliyongalati lwii pandi yoti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">kiyekale saki sabia maundi gagatopi gi iyula.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Unanganu wamulika palongi jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">kwalipuka makalakala ga mwotu.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Bambu Sapanga nkolongu jwatulama kuhuma kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">sauti jaka Sapanga jojubii kunani ngani jatenda kujowaneka.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Jwaalapula abaja mikoa nukwaapesangana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">jwamulika kitobi nukwaahenga atila.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Bambu Sapanga pajwaalakalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kupete kupomo kwiimbulu jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">pandu punhwanga papanyoliki patenda kuyekuliwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">misingi junndema jatenda kubonikana.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Sapanga jwatondabia kuboku kwaki kuhuma kunani nukunyelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kuhuma mu masi gingi jwatenda kundondabe.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Jwamoa kuhuma kuku mbaja wangu jojubii namakili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">jwahokula kuhuma kwa bandu bababia atenda kunzuki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">ndaba babia na makili gingi gukunhwesa.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Bangupalia panabia mu mang'aliku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">lakini Bambu Sapanga jwabia jojunyangati.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Jwaneta nukumeka pandu paasapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">jwanhenga mia namwomi ndaba jwatenda kumbala.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Bambu Sapanga jwambekia seketuli ndaba nhenga gajupala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">jutenda kumbenge ndaba ngasemii na makosa.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Ndaba mbwatiki gala gajupala Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">wala ngasenabi kutali na Sapanga wangu kupete mahakau.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Ngamwi malagalaki gaki goti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">ngasenakotwiki kupwata miilu jaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Palongi jaki ngasenabii na makosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">nilikengiki niihenga na makosa.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Bambu Sapanga jundunziki kulengana na uwamboni wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">jombi jumanya kubanga ngasemii na makosa.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Weapa gubi weguhobaleka kwa kwabandu baahobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">waamboni kwa bandu baabi baamboni.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Weapa ujagani kwabandu baajagani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">lakini gubii niinyela kwa bandu baabi na mahakau.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Wehapa waaoko baabiliulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">lakini waalingali baabikipuna ili kwahulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Mwabambu sapanga, mwehapa ndi taa jango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Sapanga wangu weguhenga lwii lwangu kuba unanganu.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Wehapa gumbeke makili gaka alapu abaja bangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">nu gumbeke makili gukuhomba lumatu lwaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Sejuhenga Sapanga ngasekibii na makosa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Lilagi laka bambu Sapanga ndi lelihobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">jombi ndi ngau kwa boti babuntili.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Nya jojubii Sapanga ila pe Bambu Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Nya jojubii lilibu la womi ila pe Sapanga witu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Sapanga ndi jojojumbeke makili panumbutukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">nukuhenga indela jangu kuba jejijagani.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Jugahengikina magolu gangu gabia nganganganga ngati holoku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">nukumeka mia na mwomi panani ji itombi.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Jumola kukomana ngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">maboku gangu gawesa kuhuta nkoa wa madini ga shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Gumbeki ngau jaku juku nhoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">gunyangati mia nu nkolongu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Gujibei indela jangu kuba nyipi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">wala magolu gangu ngaseganyelambwike.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Naakaguli abaja bangu na kwaakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">ngasenakelabwiki kunyuma mbaka pabakuwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Naakomiki na kwaahabu pai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">biiwesa kujumuka kabe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">baabuka pai ja magolu gango.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Wehapa wambeki makili gukukomana ngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">wahengiki abaja bangu ajinama pai ja magolu gangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Wahengiki abaja bangu atilaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">na bababia atenda kunzuki natenda kwaakoma.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Bataputa mundu jwakwajangati lakini ngasejwabia mundu jwa kwaako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">bunndelila Bambu Sapanga lakini ngasejwaajibwike.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Naalimanga na kwaaponda ngati luombi lumundema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">naapondiki na kwaakanyati ngati makandu mwiindela.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Wehapa watenda kunhoko kukukomana na bandu bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">gunhengiki kuba kilongosi wa bandu bi milema jingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Bandu banga kummnaya batenda kundumaki.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Ageni banhikila koni bilihulwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">pabajowania pe majambu gangu batenda kunyetake.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Ageni basoka makili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">bahika kuhuma ku ngomi yabu koni atenda kubagaja.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Bambu Sapanga jubii mwomi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Julumbalika lilibu wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Julumbalika Sapanga wangu lilibu langu jojunhokwi nepani.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Jombi junhwesisi kulepesa kisasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">nu kwahenga bandu bi milema jengi abia pai juulongosi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Junhokwi kuhuma kwa abaja bangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Mwa Bambu Sapanga wanhenga naawesa abaja bangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">nukunhoko kuhuma kwa bandu abaja.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Henu nagulumbalia kwa bandu bi milema joti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">mwa Bambu Sapanga niijemba nhwambu ukulilumbali lihina laku.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Sapanga anhwesesa bambu nkolongu waki kuwesa ngondu kukolongu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">anndangi upali waki joanhagwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">ena anzangati Daudi ni kibeleku saki yaka petapeta.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Maloba ga mwisu gaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Ganga ndi malobi gamwisu gaka Daudi. Malobi gaka Daudi mwana waka Yese, malobi gaka mundu jojuwe Sapanga anhengiki jubia mundu nkolongu. Sapanga waka Yakobu anhagula Daudi kuba bambu nkolongu na malobi gaki haga Aizilaeli batoguli kugajemba.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Lohoo jaka bambu Sapanga jilongii kupete nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">jwagabeka malobi gaki mu nndomu wangu. <verse eid="2SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Sapanga juku Izilaeli jupwagiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">Lilibu luku Izilaeli jumbwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Mundu jojwaalongo bandu ngati hejupala Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">jojulongo ku kunzogopa Sapanga,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />jwombi ndi jubii ngati unang'anu gupulukela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">liyoba helipita pulukela panga namaundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">enaa ngati iyula jejimelesa manyoi pai.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Hela ndi Sapanga hejulupengi lukolu lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Ndaba juhengiki lilaganu na nepani la yaka petapeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">lilaganu le lijagani na lelibonikana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Najombi jwiihenga mbata hindu yoti yeniipala.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Lakini banga kunndumbali Sapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">boti abii ngati mia yebiileke pee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">ndaba ngaseiwesikana kuijuku kwa maboku,<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />kuikamu lasima kutumi kisomasoma au mpini gunkoa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Bandu haba biikuwa tipitipi kwa mwotu.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bamba akomana ngondu baka Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1Majambu gi Ipindi 11:10-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Ganga ndi maina ga akomana ngondu bababia na Daudi, Yoshebu Bashebeti na bandu ba musi uku Takumoni jojwabia kilongosi jwa bandu atatu bala, jombi jwakomana kunkoa waki nu kukoma bandu mia nani kipindi simu.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Jwapili jwabia Eleazali mwana waka Dodo, ju ukoo waka Mwahohi. Lisoma limu Eleazali jwabia pamu na Daudi pababia baatondo Afilisiti bababia akusanyiki kukomana ngondu. Aizalaeli baatila Afilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Lakini Eleazali jwajemiki ngaganganga nukukomana na Afilisiti mbaka kuboku kwaki pawasindwa kupenda nukuigali gukamulaki upanga waki. Lisoba heli Bambu Sapanga jwaahenga baawesa ngamaa Afilisiti. Ebabiya baawesiki Aizilaeli bajenda pandu pajwabi Eliazali nu kujuku hindu kuhuma kwa Afilisiti baawii.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Jonzo ndi nkomana ngondu wa tatu ankema Shama mwana waka Agee, mundu juku Halali. Afilisiti bakusanyiki ku Lea, pandu papabii nu ngonda gowabii na ndambai yingi, nabombi Aizilaeli baatiliki Afilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Lakini Shama jwajemiki nganganganga pikilanda junngonda hogu ili kugukengale nngonda najombi jwaakoma Afilisiti. Bambu Sapanga jwatenda kuwesa ngamaa.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Ndienu akomana ngondu atatu kati ja akolongu selasini bahuluka kipindi sukuusa ilebi nukunhiki Daudi ku likolu ku Adulamu. Kipindi sehesi akomana ngondu ba Afilisiti babia atemi kuligomba luku Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Najombi Daudi kipindi sehesi jwabia mu nyumba ja akomana ngondu, na akomana ngondu ba Afilisiti bakabi ku musi uku Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Ndi Daudi jwalongila kwa hamu ngolongu, “Anape mundu jwakawesa kumbeke masi gakunywa kuhuma mu kiliba suku Betelehemu, sekibii pambipi ni litanga la musi!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Akomana ngondu baki atatu bala bapita nukupeta pikilanda ja akomana ngondu ba Afilisiti nukujenda kuteka masi mu kiliba suku Beteleemu, pambipi ni litanga la musi nukunndete Daudi. Lakini Daudi jwakana kunywa badala jaki jwajitila pai kuba litambiku kwaka Bambu Sapanga, <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />koni jwaka pwaga, “Ngasembalika kunywa masi ngati ganga hata kasokopi, Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, boo, ganga le nga ngati mwai gwa bandu bababia tayali hata kuwa ili kugaleta masi gangane?” Ndienu ngase jwakunywiki masi gala. Haga ndi majambu gabahenga akomana ngondu atatu bala.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai nndongu waka Yoabu mwana waka Seluya jwabia nkolongu wa akomana ngondu selasini. Jombi jwakomana kunkoa waki na bandu mia itatu, jwaakoma nukumanyikana ngamaa ngati ja akomana ngondu bangi atatu bala. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Boo, hoju ngasejwapatiki isima ngani kupeta atatu bala? Ndienu jwabia kilongosi wabu, lakini ngasejwamanyikini ngani ngati atatu bala. <verse eid="2SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Najombi Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada kuhuma ku Kabizeeli jwabia nkomana ngondu nkolongu jojwahenga majambu gingi gangondu. Jwaakoma akomana ngondu abeli bababia banamakili kupeta boti buku Moabu. Kabee jwauluka mulibomba lisoba lelabi na balafu nu kulikoma lihimba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Kabee julikoma limundu luku Misili. Mmisili hoju jwabi nu nkoa, lakini Benaya anzendila koni jubi na ndonga pe, anyaga nkoa gola nukunkoma Mmisili jola kunkoa waki mwene. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada jwahengiki majambu ganga, nukumanyikana kati ja akomana ngondu atatu bala. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Ndi jwapatiki isima ngolongu kati ja akomana ngondu selasini bala, hatangati ngasejwabi ngati akomana ngondu atatu bala. Najombi Daudi anhagula Benaya hoju kuba kilongosi jwa alonda baki mweni. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Asaheli ndongu waka Yoabu, jwabia jumu kati ja akomana ngondu selasini. Akomana ngondu bangi baka Daudi babia, Elianani, mwana waka Dodo juku Beteleemu, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama mundu juku Halodi na Elika mundu juku Halodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi mundu juku Paliti na Ila mwana waka Ikeshi mundu juku Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeli mundu juku Anatoti na Mebunai mundu juku Hushati, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salumoni mundu juku Hohi na Mahalai mundu juku Netofati, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwana waka Baana, kuhumi ku Netofati, Itai mwana waka Libai kuhuma ku Gibea mu Benyamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya, kuhumi ku Pilatoni na Hidai mundu juku ilosi yuku Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni mundu juku Alibati na, Azimaweti mundu juku Bahulimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba mundu juku Shaaliboni na bana baka Yasheni na Yonasani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Shama mundu juku Halali, Ahimu mwana waka Shalali mundu juku Halali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana waka Ahasibai mundu juku Maaka na Eliamu mwana waka Ahitofeli mundu juku Giloni, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hesilawi mundu juku Kalimeli na Paalai mundu juku Mwalibi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwana waka Natani mundu juku Soba na Bani mundu juku Gadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki mundu juku Amoni na Nahalai mundu juku Beeloti jojabii jojutoto hindu yukukomane yaka Yoabu mwana waka Seluya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />na Galebu mundu juku Hiti, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Ulia mundu Hiti. Boti babia akomana ngondu selasini na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jwaabalanga Aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1Majambu gi Ipindi 21:1-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Kwi kipindi sengi kabee Bambu Sapanga jwaayome Aizilaeli, anhenga Daudi kuleta ling'ai kwabu, ampwagila jwaabalanga bandu buku Izilaeli na bandu buku Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu ampwagila Yoabu na akolongu ba akomana ngondu bababia pamu najombi, “Nzendania ku makabila goti guku Izilaeli kuhuma ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba, mwakaabalanga bandu ili manya abii ale.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Lakini Yoabu ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jwaajonzukia Aizilaeli mala mia jimu kupeta heabii sajenu nawehapa bambu nkolongu waku guwesa kulinga kujonzukeka hoku kwa miu gaku wamweti. Lakini ndaba jakii we wabambu wangu gutogule lijambu lehele?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Lakini lilobi laka bambu nkolongu labii na makili kupeta Yoabu na akolongu ba akomana ngondu. Ndi Yoabu na akolongu ba akomana ngondu baboka palongi jaka bambu nkolongu nu kujenda kwaabalanga Aizilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Balombuka losi lwa Yoludani batumbulia kubalanga bandu kutumbuli ku Aloeli na losi lolubii ku ligomba lu kujenda ku Gadi mbaka ku Yazeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Ndi bajenda ku Gileadi nuku Kadeshi kunndema ja Ahiti nuku Dani bayonguluta kujenda Sidoni, <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />nu kuhika mu nyumba ja musi uku Tilu na bajingala mu misi joti ja Ahivi na Akaanani. Ndi bahuma hoku bajenda ku upandi u kusini juku Yuda ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Pabajomula kupete mu nndema woti babuja ku Yelusalemu baada ja miei tisa na masoba ishilini. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Ndienu Yoabu ampelakia bambu nkolongu esabu ja bandu. Mu Izilaeli kwabia na akanalomi babawesa kukomana ngondu laki nani bababii nu umanyi ukutumi mapanga, nuku Yuda kwabia na akanalomi laki nhwanu.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Lakini Daudi jwaangajiki ngamaa mu mwoju waki ejajomuliya kwaabalanga bandu. Ndienu Daudi ampwagila Bambu Sapanga, “Nhengiki mahakau makolongu kupete lihengu lenhengiki. Lakini henu mwaa Bambu Sapanga nuguloba gunekakia mahakau nepani ntumisi waku ndaba nhengiki lijambu liking'ang'a ngamaa.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Daudi pajwajumuka kilabu jaki pulukela, kipindi hesi Bambu Sapanga ampekia malobi nndota waki Gadi mundu waka bambu nkolongu Daudi mundu wehoju jojubona hindu yeipitila palongi, kupwaaga, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Gujenda ukumpwagila Daudi ana, ‘Bambu Sapanga jupwaga jugupeke majambu matatu na wehapa guhagula limu nanepani niitenda kuguhenge.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Ndi Gadi anzendila Daudi nukumpwagi kuni jupwaga, “Boo, gupala inzala ja yaka saba juguhikila mu nndema wako? Au boo, wehapa lee waatila aka abaja baku kwa miei ji tatu pabukupwatalila? Au kubia na masoba matatu gaguge nndema waku wiibia na wiibia na magonzu gabaja? Guwasalia alapu wiimbekia lijibu lukumpeke jojundumiki.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi anzibua Gadi, “Mii na ni kiholu kikolongu, lakini nambanga junapu Bambu Sapanga kuliku kunapu na bandu ndaba jombi jubii ni ikia ngamaa.” <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Ndi Bambu Sapanga jwaaletila Aizilaeli magonzu tumbuka pulukela mbaka kipindi sebapangiki. Bandu elupu sabini bakuwa mu nndema woti kuhuma ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Lakini kipindi ntumi jukunani pajwatondubia kuboku kwaki kulangi ku musi uku Yelusalemu ili kuguhalabana, Bambu Sapanga jwang'anambua mawasu gaki. Bambu Sapanga ampwagila ntumi jukunani jola jojaakoma bandu, “Henu kutosike kelabua kuboku kwaku.” Ntumi jukunani jwabia jujemiki pambipi nu lubanza lukupete ilebi lwaka Alauna mundu juku Yebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi paambona Ntumi jukunani jojabia jwaakoma bandu, ampwagila Bambu Sapanga, “Linga nepani ndi nhengiki mahakau nukukose. Bandu haba ngaseahengiki mahakau. Nuguloba ngamaa gunapula nepani na alongu bango.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Lisoba alela Gadi anzendila Daudi nukumpwagi, “Kwela kunani ukunsengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiiki matambiku, pikibanza sukupete ilebi saka Alauna mundu juku Yebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Ndienu, Daudi jwakwela kunani kulengana ni lilobi laka Gadi ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalaki. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Alauna pajwalingalia upandi ukumosu ambona bambu nkolongu anhegale na atumisi baki, najombi jwapita nukujenda kundamuki bambu nkolongu jwajinama mbaka pai puluombi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Ndi Alauna anndalukia bambu nkolongu, “Ndaba jakii bambu nkolongu wangu junhiki nepani ntumisi wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daudi jwajibua, “Nhikiki kuheme lubanza lwaku lukupete ilebi ili nunsengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiiki matambiku ili ugonzu watauni gowaapatiki bandu gukotukaje.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Najombi Alauna ampwagila Daudi, Bambu wangu nkolongu jukua sokapi segubona sasapi gupia matambiku. Nepani mbia makambaku ga ng'ombi aga kwa ndaba ja matambiku gukutini na hindu yukupete ilebi aye ni mikongu jukukonge ng'ombi kuba nhanzu. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Hei yoti wa bambu nkolongu ndenda kugupeke. Nhobale Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jwiijopa matambiku gaku.<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Lakini bambu nkolongu anzibua Alauna, “Ngahela, nepani niilomba kwaku kwa bei jaki. Nganampiiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, matambiku gukutinyi yanga kuihenge namweti lihengu.” Ndi bambu nkolongu jwalomba lubanza lu kupete ilebi ku ipandi hamsini yu lupija. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Ndienu, Daudi ansengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiiki matambiku pandu pala nukumpiiki matambiku gukutinyi na gulukwali. Ndi Bambu Sapanga jwajetakia kuloba kwaki kwa ndaba junndema gola nu ugonzu wa tauni gowaapata bandu buku Izilaeli watenda kukotoka.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>